<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Revelasyon</para>
  <para style="toc1">REVELASYON</para>
  <para style="toc2">Revelasyon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rev</para>
  <para style="mt1">REVELASYON</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1"/>Revelasyon a Jésus Kri, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:8">Jn 17:8</ref></char></note>Bondye te bay Li pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:6">Rev 22:6</ref></char></note>montre a sèvitè Li yo; bagay ki t ap oblije rive avan lontan yo, ke Li te voye kominike pa zanj Li, a sèvitè Li, Jean, <verse eid="REV 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2"/>ki te temwaye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:9">Rev 1:9</ref></char></note>pawòl Bondye a, ak temwayaj Jésus Kri a, menm a tout sa li te wè yo.<verse eid="REV 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 11:28">Luc 11:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Beni se sila ki li e sila ki tande pawòl pwofesi sila yo, e ki prete atansyon a bagay ki ekri ladann yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:10">Rev 22:10</ref></char></note>Paske tan an pwòch.<verse eid="REV 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4"/>Jean, a sèt legliz ki an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:9">Trav 2:9</ref></char></note>Asie yo: Gras pou nou ak lapè, ki soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:8">Rev 1:8</ref></char></note>Sila ki la, ki te la, e ki va vini an; ki soti anplis nan sèt lespri ki devan twòn Li an; <verse eid="REV 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5"/>e nan Jésus Kri, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:14">Rev 3:14</ref></char></note>temwen fidèl la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:20">I Kor 15:20</ref></char></note>premye ne de lanmò a, e chèf a wa latè yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">A Sila ki renmen nou an, ki te libere nou de peche nou yo pa san Li— <verse eid="REV 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6"/>epi Li te fè nou vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:10">Rev 5:10</ref></char></note>Wayòm, prèt a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:6">Wo 15:6</ref></char></note>Bondye e Papa Li a. A Li menm laglwa, ak règn pou tout tan e pou tout tan. Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gade byen, l ap vini avèk nwaj yo, e tout zye va wè L, menm sila ki te pèse L yo. Tout tribi sou latè yo va fè gwo lamantasyon sou Li. Se konsa l ap fèt. Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen se </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 21:6">Rev 21:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Alfa a e Omega a,” </char> di Senyè Bondye a: <char style="wj">“Sila ki la, ki te la, e ki va vini an, Toupwisan an.” </char><verse eid="REV 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9"/>Mwen, Jean, frè nou, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:22">Trav 14:22</ref></char></note>patisipe avèk nou nan tribilasyon, wayòm, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 3:5">I Tes 3:5</ref></char></note>pèseverans ki nan Jésus a, te sou lil ki rele Patmos la, akoz pawòl a Bondye ak temwayaj de Jésus a.<verse eid="REV 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10"/>Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:43">Mat 22:43</ref></char></note>nan Lespri a nan jou Senyè a, e mwen te tande dèyè m yon gwo vwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:1">Rev 4:1</ref></char></note>tankou son a yon twonpèt, <verse eid="REV 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11"/>ki t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:19">Rev 1:19</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Ekri nan yon liv sa ou wè a, e voye l nan sèt legliz yo; nan Éphèse, Smyrne, Pergame, Thyatire, Sardes, Philadelphie ak Laodicée.” </char><verse eid="REV 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12"/>Alò, mwen te vire pou wè vwa ki t ap pale avè m nan. Epi nan vire, mwen te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:37">Egz 25:37</ref></char></note>sèt chandelye ki fèt an lò. <verse eid="REV 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13"/>Nan mitan chandelye yo, mwen te wè yon moun tankou yon fis a lòm, abiye nan yon wòb ki rive jis nan pye, e mare lestonmak li ak yon sentiwon an lò. <verse eid="REV 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14"/>Tèt Li ak cheve Li te blan tankou lèn blanch, tankou lanèj. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7:9</ref></char></note>Zye li te tankou yon flanm dife. <verse eid="REV 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 1:7">Esd 1:7</ref></char></note>Pye Li te tankou bwonz cho lè l chofe nan fou, epi vwa l te tankou bri anpil dlo. <verse eid="REV 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16"/>Nan men dwat Li, Li te kenbe sèt etwal. Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:2">És 49:2</ref></char></note>nepe file de bò te sòti nan bouch Li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:2">Mat 17:2</ref></char></note>Figi Li te tankou solèy k ap briye nan pwisans li.<verse eid="REV 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17"/>Lè m te wè Li, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:17">Dan 8:17</ref></char></note>tonbe nan pye Li tankou yon moun mouri. Li te poze men dwat Li sou mwen, e te di: <char style="wj">“Pa pè; Mwen se</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">És 44:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">premye ak dènye a,</char> <verse eid="REV 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18"/><char style="wj">e</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:5">Luc 24:5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Sila ki viv la.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:8">Rev 2:8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen te mouri, e gade, Mwen viv pou tout tan. Amen. Mwen gen kle Lanmò ak Sejou Lanmò yo.</char><verse eid="REV 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Konsa, </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 1:11">Rev 1:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">ekri </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 1:12-16">Rev 1:12-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">bagay ke ou gen tan wè yo, bagay ki la yo, ak bagay ki va rive pi devan an.</char> <verse eid="REV 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20"/><char style="wj">Pou mistè a sèt zetwal ke ou te wè nan men dwat Mwen an, ak sèt chandelye yo: Men li: sèt zetwal yo, se zanj a</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:4-11">Rev 1:4-11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sèt legliz yo, e sèt chandelye yo, se sèt legliz yo.” </char><verse eid="REV 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“A zanj nan legliz</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:11">Rev 1:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Éphèse la, ekri: Sila ki kenbe sèt zetwal yo nan men dwat Li a, Sila ki mache pami sèt chandelye fèt an lò yo, di sa a:</char><verse eid="REV 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen konnen zèv nou yo, travay di nou an, ak pèseverans nou, ke nou pa kapab tolere moun mechan, e nou te pase an eprèv sa yo ki rele tèt yo apòt, lè l pa t vrè, epi te twouve yo fo.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:1">I Jn 4:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3"/><char style="wj">Nou gen pèseverans ak andirans</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:21">Jn 15:21</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pou koz a non Mwen, e nou pa t bouke. </char><verse eid="REV 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4"/>
    <char style="wj">“Men Mwen gen sa kont nou, ke nou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:2">Jr 2:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">kite premye lanmou nou an.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5"/><char style="wj">Alò, sonje kote nou te tonbe a, epi</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:16-22">Rev 2:16-22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">repanti e</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:32">Eb 10:32</ref></char></note><char style="wj">fè zèv ke nou te fè avan yo; sinon Mwen ap vini kote nou pou retire chandelye nou an nan plas li, amwenske nou repanti.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6"/><char style="wj">Poutan nou genyen sa a, ke nou rayi zèv</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:15">Rev 2:15</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Nikolayityen yo, ke Mwen menm, Mwen rayi tou. </char><verse eid="REV 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sila ki gen yon zòrèy la, kite li tande sa Lespri a di a legliz yo. A sila ki venkè a, Mwen va kite l manje nan</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Jen 2:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pyebwa lavi a ki nan Paradi Bondye a.</char><verse eid="REV 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“A zanj legliz Smyrne lan, ekri: </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:6">És 44:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Premye ak dènye a, ki te mouri an, e ki te retounen a lavi a, di sa a:</char> <verse eid="REV 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9"/><char style="wj">Mwen konnen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:9">Rev 1:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">tribilasyon ak povrete nou (men nou rich); epi blasfèm pa sila ki di yo se Jwif men ki pa sa yo, men ki se yon sinagòg pou Satan.</char><verse eid="REV 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10"/>
    <char style="wj">“Pa pè pou sa nou prèt pou soufri yo. Veye, dyab la prèt pou voye kèk nan nou nan prizon, pou nou kab pase a leprèv, e nou va gen tribilasyon pandan di jou.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:13">Rev 2:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Rete fidèl jiska lanmò, e mwen va bannou kouwòn lavi a.</char><verse eid="REV 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sila ki gen yon zòrèy la, kite l tande sa Lespri a di a legliz yo. Sila ki venkè a, p ap soufri donmaj pa</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:6">Rev 20:6</ref>,<ref loc="REV 20:14">14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">dezyèm lanmò a.</char><verse eid="REV 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“A zanj legliz nan Pergame nan, ekri: Sila a ki gen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:16">Rev 1:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nepe file de bò a, di sa a: </char><verse eid="REV 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13"/>
    <char style="wj">Mwen konnen kote nou rete, kote twòn a Satan an ye. Nou kenbe fèm nan Non Mwen, e nou pa t nye lafwa nan Mwen an, menm nan jou Antipas yo,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:20">Trav 22:20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">temwen Mwen an, fidèl Mwen an, ki te touye pami nou, kote Satan rete a.</char><verse eid="REV 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Men Mwen gen kèk bagay kont nou; paske nou gen la kèk moun ki kenbe nan ansèyman Balaam, ki te ansenye Balak pou mete yon wòch chite devan fis Israël yo,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1">Nonb 25:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pou manje bagay ki te sakrifye a zidòl e komèt zak imoral.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15"/><char style="wj">Konsa tou, nou gen kèk moun ki, nan menm jan an, k ap kenbe sou ansèyman </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:6">Rev 2:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Nikolayityen yo.</char><verse eid="REV 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Konsa,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:5">Rev 2:5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">repanti; sinon, Mwen va vini kote nou vit, e Mwen va fè lagè kont yo avèk</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:16">Rev 1:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">nepe a bouch Mwen an.</char><verse eid="REV 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sila ki gen yon zòrèy la, kite l tande sa Lespri a di a legliz yo. A sila ki venkè a, a li menm, Mwen va bay kèk nan lamàn kache a, e Mwen va ba li yon wòch blan avèk yon non tounèf ki ekri sou wòch la</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:12">Rev 19:12</ref></char></note><char style="wj">ke pèsòn p ap konnen, sinon sila ki resevwa l la.</char><verse eid="REV 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“A zanj a legliz nan Thyatire a, ekri: Fis Bondye a,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:14">Rev 1:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">ki gen zye tankou yon flanm dife a e pye tankou bwonz poli a, di sa a: </char> <verse eid="REV 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:2">Rev 2:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen konnen zèv nou yo, lanmou nou, lafwa, sèvis, ak pèseverans, e ke zèv nou dènye tan sa yo pi gran pase avan yo.</char><verse eid="REV 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Men Mwen gen sa kont nou, ke nou tolere fanm</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:31">I Wa 16:31</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Jézabel la, ki rele tèt li pwofetès, e ki ansenye pou fè egare sèvitè Mwen yo, pou yo kab komèt vye zak imoral e manje bagay sakrifye a zidòl.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:9">II Pi 3:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen te ba li tan pou repanti, e li</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:5">Wo 2:5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pa vle repanti de imoralite li yo. </char><verse eid="REV 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Gade byen, Mwen va jete li sou yon kabann plen maladi, e sila ki</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:2">Rev 17:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">fè adiltè yo avèk li nan gran tribilasyon an, amwenske yo repanti de zèv li yo.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23"/><char style="wj">Konsa, Mwen va touye pitit li yo avèk gwo maladi lapès, e tout legliz yo va konnen ke Mwen menm se Sila ki</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:9">Sòm 7:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sonde panse ak kè yo. Mwen va bay nou chak selon zèv nou.</char><verse eid="REV 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Men Mwen di nou, rès moun ki nan Thyatire yo, ki pa kenbe a doktrin sila a, ki pa t konnen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:10">Kol 2:10</ref></char></note><char style="wj">bagay pwofon a Satan yo, jan yo rele yo a, Mwen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:28">Trav 15:28</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pa mete lòt fado sou nou. </char> <verse eid="REV 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25"/><char style="wj">Sepandan</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:11">Rev 3:11</ref></char></note><char style="wj">kenbe fèm a sa nou genyen an jiskaske M vini.</char><verse eid="REV 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sila ki venkè a, e sila ki kenbe zèv Mwen yo jiska lafen an,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:8">Sòm 2:8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">a li menm Mwen va bay otorite sou nasyon yo.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27"/><char style="wj">Li va gouvène yo avèk yon baton fè,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:14">És 30:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">tankou veso ajil ki vin kraze an mòso, jan Mwen menm te resevwa otorite soti nan Papa M nan;</char> <verse eid="REV 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28"/><char style="wj">epi Mwen va ba li</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:2">I Jn 3:2</ref></char></note><char style="wj">zetwal maten an.</char><verse eid="REV 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 2:7">Rev 2:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Sila ki gen yon zòrèy la, kite l tande sa Lespri a di a legliz yo”. </char><verse eid="REV 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“A zanj legliz nan Sardes la, ekri: Sila ki gen sèt Lespri Bondye ak</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:16">Rev 1:16</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sèt zetwal yo, di sa a: Mwen konnen zèv nou yo, ke nou gen repitasyon ke nou vivan, men nou mouri.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2"/><char style="wj">Reveye nou, e ranfòse bagay ki rete yo, ke ou te prèt pou jete deyò; paske Mwen pa twouve zèv nou yo konplè nan zye Bondye.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:5">Rev 2:5</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Donk, sonje sa nou te resevwa e tande a. Kenbe l e repanti. Konsa, si nou pa reveye nou, Mwen va vini tankou yon vòlè, e nou p ap konnen a kilè Mwen va vini sou nou an.</char><verse eid="REV 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4"/>
    <char style="wj">“Men nou gen kèk moun nan Sardes ki pa t sal vètman yo.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:23">Jd 23</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Yo va mache avèk Mwen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 9:8">Ekl 9:8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">abiye an blan, paske yo dign de sa.</char><verse eid="REV 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sila ki vin venkè a va abiye konsa, an vètman blan. Mwen p ap janm efase non li nan liv lavi a, e</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:32">Mat 10:32</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen va konfese non li devan Papa M ak devan zanj Li yo. </char> <verse eid="REV 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:7">Rev 2:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Sila ki gen yon zòrèy, kite l tande sa Lespri a di a legliz yo.</char><verse eid="REV 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“A zanj legliz nan Philadelphie a, ekri: Sila ki sen an, ki vrè a, ki gen</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:22">És 22:22</ref></char></note><char style="wj">kle David la, k ap louvri pou pèsòn p ap ka fèmen l, e ki fèmen pou pèsòn p ap ka louvri a, di konsa:</char> <verse eid="REV 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8"/><char style="wj">Mwen konnen zèv nou yo. Gade byen, Mwen mete devan nou yon pòt louvri ke pèsòn pa kab fèmen, paske nou gen yon ti pouvwa, epi nou te kenbe pawòl Mwen, e</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:13">Rev 2:13</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pa t nye non Mwen.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9"/><char style="wj">Gade byen, Mwen va koze sila ki nan</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:9">Rev 2:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">sinagòg Satan yo, ki di ke yo se Jwif, men ki pa sa a, kap manti—Mwen va fè yo</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:14">És 45:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">vin bese nan pye nou, e fè yo konnen ke Mwen renmen nou.</char><verse eid="REV 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10"/>
    <char style="wj">“Paske nou kenbe pawòl pèseverans Mwen an, Mwen va kenbe nou osi nan lè eprèv la, lè ki prèt pou vini sou tout</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:14">Rev 16:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">mond lan pou pase a leprèv tout sila ki rete sou latè yo.</char><verse eid="REV 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen ap vini vit!</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:10">Rev 2:10</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Kenbe fèm a sa nou genyen an, jis pou pèsòn pa rache kouwòn nou an.</char><verse eid="REV 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sila ki venkè a, Mwen va fè li vin yon</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:9">Gal 2:9</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pilye nan tanp a Bondye Mwen an. Konsa, li p ap sòti deyò ankò, e Mwen va ekri sou li </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:1">Rev 14:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">non a Bondye Mwen an, ak non a gran vil Bondye Mwen an, Jérusalem tounèf la, ki desann soti nan syèl, de Bondye Mwen, avèk non tounèf Mwen an.</char><verse eid="REV 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 3:6">Rev 3:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Sila ki gen yon zòrèy la, kite li tande sa Lespri a di a legliz yo”.</char><verse eid="REV 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“A zanj legliz nan Laodicée a, ekri:</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:20">II Kor 1:20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Amen lan, </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:7">Rev 3:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Fidèl e Vrè Temwen lan, Kòmansman kreyasyon Bondye la, di konsa:</char> <verse eid="REV 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:1">Rev 3:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen konnen zèv nou yo, ke nou pa ni frèt ni cho. Mwen ta pito ke nou te frèt oswa cho.</char><verse eid="REV 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Donk, paske nou tyèd, e nou pa cho ni frèt, Mwen va krache nou sòti nan bouch Mwen. </char> <verse eid="REV 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17"/><char style="wj">Paske nou di: </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:8">Os 12:8</ref></char></note><char style="wj">“Mwen rich! Mwen gen tan ranmase yon fòtin, e mwen pa bezwen anyen”; men nou pa konnen ke nou se malere, mizerab, pòv, avèg, e toutouni. </char><verse eid="REV 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Konsa, mwen konseye nou</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:44">Mat 13:44</ref></char></note><char style="wj">achte nan men Mwen lò ki rafine nan dife pou nou kapab vin rich, e vètman blan pou mete sou nou pou wont toutouni nou an pa vin parèt; ak pomad zye pou nou pase nan zye nou pou nou kapab vin wè.</char><verse eid="REV 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:12">Pwov 3:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Sila ke M renmen yo, Mwen reprimande e disipline yo. Konsa, se pou nou vin plen ak zèl, e repanti. </char><verse eid="REV 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Gade byen, Mwen kanpe nan pòt la e Mwen frape. Si yon moun tande vwa M, e ouvri pòt la, </char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 14:23">Jn 14:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Mwen va antre kote li, Mwen va dine avè l, e li menm avè M.</char><verse eid="REV 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sila ki venkè a, Mwen va lèse l vin chita avè M sou twòn Mwen an, jan</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:33">Jn 16:33</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen menm tou te vin venkè a, e te vin chita avèk Papa M sou twòn Li an.</char><verse eid="REV 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 2:7">Rev 2:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">“Sila ki gen yon zòrèy la, kite li tande sa Lespri a di a legliz yo”. </char><verse eid="REV 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1"/>Apre bagay sa yo, mwen te gade, e vwala, yon pòt ki louvri nan syèl la. Premye vwa m te tande a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:10">Rev 1:10</ref></char></note>te tankou son yon twonpèt k ap pale avè m, ki t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:12">Rev 11:12</ref></char></note>“Monte isit la, e mwen va montre ou sa ki dwe rive apre bagay sa yo.”<verse eid="REV 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2"/>La menm, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:10">Rev 1:10</ref></char></note>nan Lespri a. Epi gade byen, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:19">I Wa 22:19</ref></char></note>twòn te kanpe nan syèl la, e yon moun te chita sou twòn nan. <verse eid="REV 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3"/>Epi Sila ki te chita a te gen aparans yon pyè jasp ak yon sadwàn. Konsa, te gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:28">Éz 1:28</ref></char></note>lakansyèl ozanviwon de twòn lan, ak aparans yon emwòd. <verse eid="REV 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4"/>Ozanviwon de twòn lan se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:16">Rev 11:16</ref></char></note>venn-kat twòn: epi ozanviwon de twòn yo, mwen te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:10">Rev 4:10</ref></char></note>venn-kat ansyen yo chita, abiye an vètman blan, e kouwòn an lò sou tèt yo. <verse eid="REV 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5"/>Sòti nan twòn nan se te gwo kout ekleraj, gwo son loraj, ak gwo kout tonnè. Konsa, te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:37">Egz 25:37</ref></char></note>sèt lanp dife ki t ap brile devan twòn nan, ki se sèt Lespri Bondye yo. <verse eid="REV 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6"/>Epi devan twòn nan, te gen yon bagay tankou yon lanmè glas kristal. Nan mitan e ozanviwon de twòn lan, kat kreyati vivan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:18">Éz 1:18</ref></char></note>ranpli avèk zye pa devan kou pa dèyè. <verse eid="REV 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:10">Éz 1:10</ref></char></note>Premye kreyati a te tankou yon lyon, dezyèm kreyati a te tankou yon ti towo bèf, twazyèm kreyati a te gen yon figi tankou yon moun, e katriyèm kreyati a te tankou yon èg k ap vole anlè. <verse eid="REV 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8"/>Epi kat kreyati vivan yo, yo chak avèk sis zèl, ranpli avèk zye toutotou e anndan. San repo, lajounen kon lannwit, yo pa t sispann di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:3">És 6:3</ref></char></note>“Sen, sen, sen, se Senyè a, Bondye a, Toupwisan an, ki te la, ki la, e ki va vini an.”<verse eid="REV 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9"/>Lè kreyati vivan yo fin bay glwa, lonè ak remèsiman a Sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 47:8">Sòm 47:8</ref></char></note>chita sou twòn lan, a Sila ki viv pou tout tan e pou tout tan an, <verse eid="REV 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10"/>venn-kat ansyen yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:8">Rev 5:8</ref>,<ref loc="REV 5:14">14</ref></char></note>tonbe devan Sila ki chita sou twòn lan pou adore Sila ki viv pou tout tan e pou tout tan an, e yo jete kouwòn yo devan twòn lan, pandan y ap di: <verse eid="REV 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11"/>“Dign se Ou Menm, Senyè nou, e Bondye nou an, pou resevwa glwa, lonè ak pwisans; paske Ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:15">Trav 14:15</ref></char></note>kreye tout bagay, e akoz volonte Ou, yo te egziste e te kreye.”<verse eid="REV 4:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1"/>Mwen te wè nan men dwat a Sila ki te chita sou twòn lan, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:9">Éz 2:9</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 2:10">10</ref></char></note>liv ki te ekri pa anndan kou pa deyò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:11">És 29:11</ref></char></note>sele avèk sèt so.<verse eid="REV 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2"/>Mwen te wè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 10:1">Rev 10:1</ref></char></note>zanj pwisan ki t ap pwoklame nan yon vwa fò: “Kilès ki dign pou louvri liv la, e kase so li yo?”<verse eid="REV 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3"/>Men pèsòn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:10">Fil 2:10</ref></char></note>nan syèl la, sou tè a, oubyen anba tè a pa t kapab ouvri liv la oubyen gade ladann.<verse eid="REV 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4"/>Alò, mwen te kòmanse kriye anpil, paske pèsòn pa t dign pou louvri liv la oubyen pou gade ladann. <verse eid="REV 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5"/>Epi youn nan ansyen yo te di m: “sispann kriye; gade byen, Lyon nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:14">Eb 7:14</ref></char></note>ki sòti nan tribi Juda a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:16">Rev 22:16</ref></char></note>Rasin a David la, te vin venkè. Li k ap ouvri liv la ak sèt so li yo.”<verse eid="REV 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6"/>Konsa, mwen te wè antre twòn lan, avèk kat kreyati vivan, ak lansyen yo, yon Jèn Mouton te kanpe, kòmsi li te touye deja, avèk sèt kòn ak<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 3:9">Za 3:9</ref></char></note>sèt zye, ki se sèt Lespri a Bondye yo, ki te voye sou tout tè a. <verse eid="REV 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7"/>Li te vini, Li te pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:1">Rev 5:1</ref></char></note>liv la nan men dwat a Sila ki te chita sou twòn lan.<verse eid="REV 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8"/>Lè L te pran liv la, kat kreyati vivan yo ak venn-kat ansyen yo te tonbe devan Jèn Mouton an, yo chak kenbe yon ap ak yon bòl fèt an lò ranpli avèk lansan, ki se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 141:2">Sòm 141:2</ref></char></note>priyè a sen yo. <verse eid="REV 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9"/>Epi yo te chante yon chan tounèf. Yo te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“Dign se Ou menm pou pran liv la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">e kase so li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Paske Ou te touye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">e Ou te achte pou Bondye avèk</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">san Ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">lèzòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:4">Dan 3:4</ref></char></note>de tout tribi, lang, pèp, ak nasyon.<verse eid="REV 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10"/>Ou te fè nou vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:6">Rev 1:6</ref></char></note>wa ak prèt yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">a Bondye nou an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">epi nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:4">Rev 20:4</ref></char></note>renye sou tè a.”<verse eid="REV 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11"/>Alò, mwen te gade, e mwen te tande vwa a anpil zanj ki te antoure twòn nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:6">Rev 4:6</ref></char></note>kreyati vivan yo ak ansyen yo. An kantite yo a te dè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:10">Dan 4:10</ref></char></note>miryad e dè miryad, epi dè milye e dè milye, <verse eid="REV 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12"/>k ap pale avèk yon vwa fò: “Dign se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:29">Jn 1:29</ref></char></note>Jèn Mouton ki te touye a, pou resevwa pwisans, richès, sajès, pouvwa, lonè, laglwa, ak benediksyon.”<verse eid="REV 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13"/>Epi tout bagay ki kreye nan syèl la, sou tè a, anba tè a, ak sou lanmè a, e tout bagay ladann yo, mwen te tande yo t ap di: “A Sila ki chita sou twòn nan, e a Jèn Mouton an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:6">Rev 1:6</ref></char></note>benediksyon, lonè, glwa, ak lafòs, pou tout tan e pou tout tan! Amen!”<verse eid="REV 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14"/>Epi kat kreyati vivan yo te kontinye ap di “Amen.” Epi lansyen yo te vin tonbe ba pou adore.<verse eid="REV 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1"/>Alò, mwen te wè lè Jèn Mouton an te kase youn nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:1">Rev 5:1</ref></char></note>sèt so yo, e mwen te tande youn nan kat kreyati vivan yo t ap di avèk yon vwa tankou tonnè “Vini”. <verse eid="REV 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2"/>Mwen te gade, e vwala, yon cheval blan te vin parèt; epi Sila ki te chita sou li a te gen yon banza nan men l. Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 6:11">Za 6:11</ref></char></note>kouwòn te bay a li menm, e li te sòti ap venk moun e espwe pou venk moun.<verse eid="REV 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3"/>Lè L te kase dezyèm so a, mwen te tande <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:7">Rev 4:7</ref></char></note>dezyèm kreyati vivan an t ap di: “Vini!” <verse eid="REV 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4"/>Alò, yon lòt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:8">Za 1:8</ref></char></note>yon cheval wouj te sòti. A sila ki te chita sou li a, sa te pèmèt pou l <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:34">Mat 10:34</ref></char></note>pran lapè soti sou tè a, e ke moun sa yo ta touye youn lòt. Yon gran nepe te mete nan men l.<verse eid="REV 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5"/>Lè Li te kase twazyèm so a, mwen te tande <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:7">Rev 4:7</ref></char></note>twazyèm kreyati vivan an, t ap di: “Vini pou wè!” Mwen te gade, e vwala, yon cheval nwa; e sila ki te chita sou li a te gen yon balans nan men l. <verse eid="REV 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6"/>Konsa, mwen te tande yon bagay tankou yon vwa nan mitan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:6">Rev 4:6</ref></char></note>kat kreyati vivan yo ki t ap di: “De gode ble pou yon denye, e sis gode lòj pou yon denye. Pa fè mal a lwil ak diven an.”<verse eid="REV 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7"/>Lè Jèn Mouton an te kase katriyèm so a, mwen te tande vwa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:7">Rev 4:7</ref></char></note>katriyèm kreyati vivan an ki t ap di “Vini pou wè”. <verse eid="REV 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8"/>Mwen te gade, e vwala, yon cheval koulè gri tankou sann, epi sila ki te chita sou li a te gen non <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 5:5">Pwov 5:5</ref></char></note>Lanmò. Konsa, Sejou Lanmò a t ap swiv li. Otorite te bay a yo menm sou yon ka latè pou yo touye avèk nepe, avèk gwo grangou, epidemi lapès, e avèk bèt sovaj latè yo.<verse eid="REV 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9"/>Lè Jèn Mouton an te kase senkyèm so a, mwen te wè anba lotèl la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:4">Rev 20:4</ref></char></note>nanm a sila yo yo te touye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:2">Rev 1:2</ref>,<ref loc="REV 1:9">9</ref></char></note>akoz de pawòl Bondye a, e akoz de temwayaj ke yo te kenbe a.<verse eid="REV 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10"/>Yo te kriye avèk yon vwa fò. Yo t ap di: “Konbyen tan, o Senyè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:7">Rev 3:7</ref></char></note>sen e veritab, èske Ou va fè reta nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Det 32:43</ref></char></note>jije e vanje san nou sou sila ki rete sou latè yo?” <verse eid="REV 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11"/>Yo te ba yo chak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:4">Rev 3:4</ref>,<ref loc="REV 3:5">5</ref></char></note>yon vètman blan. Yo te di yo ke yo ta dwe repoze pou yon ti tan toujou, jiskaske kantite sèvitè parèy yo ak frè yo ta dwe vin touye menm jan ak yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:24">Trav 20:24</ref></char></note>pou konplete kous pa yo.<verse eid="REV 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12"/>Mwen te gade lè Li te kase sizyèm so a, epi te gen yon gwo tranbleman detè. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">És 13:10</ref></char></note>Solèy la te vin nwa tankou rad antèman ki fèt avèk pwal e lalin lan te vin tankou san. <verse eid="REV 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat 24:29</ref></char></note>Konsa, zetwal nan syèl yo te tonbe sou tè a, tankou yon pye fig frans ki jete fwi vèt li lè li souke pa gwo van. <verse eid="REV 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14"/>Syèl la te fann e separe tankou yon woulo papye lè l vin woule, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:10">És 54:10</ref></char></note>tout mòn ak lil yo te deplase kite plas yo.<verse eid="REV 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">És 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 2:19">19</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 2:21">21</ref></char></note>wa latè yo, gran chèf yo, gwo moun yo, rich yo, moun dyanm yo, chak esklav ak moun lib yo, tout te kache tèt yo nan twou wòch e pami wòch mòn. <verse eid="REV 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16"/>Epi yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Os 10:8</ref></char></note>di a mòn ak wòch yo: “Tonbe sou nou, e kache nou pou nou pa wè prezans a Sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:9">Rev 4:9</ref></char></note>ki chita sou twòn nan, ak kòlè Jèn Mouton an. <verse eid="REV 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:11">Jl 2:11</ref></char></note>gran jou kòlè a gen tan vini, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:2">Mal 3:2</ref></char></note>kilès ki kapab kanpe?”<verse eid="REV 6:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1"/>Apre sa, mwen te wè kat zanj ki te kanpe nan kat kwen latè, ki t ap kenbe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:36">Jr 49:36</ref></char></note>kat van latè yo, pou van pa soufle sou tè a, sou lanmè a, ni sou okenn pyebwa.<verse eid="REV 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2"/>Mwen te wè yon lòt zanj ki t ap monte soti kote solèy la leve a, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:3">Rev 7:3</ref></char></note>so a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:16">Mat 16:16</ref></char></note>Bondye vivan an. Li te kriye fò avèk yon gwo vwa a kat zanj ki te gen pèmisyon pou fè mal a tè a ak lanmè a. <verse eid="REV 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3"/>Li te di: “Pa fè tè a, lanmè a, oubyen pyebwa yo mal jiskaske nou fin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:3-8">Rev 7:3-8</ref></char></note>sele sèvitè-atache Bondye nou yo sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Éz 9:4</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 9:6">6</ref></char></note>fon yo.” <verse eid="REV 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4"/>Konsa, mwen te tande kantite a sila ki te sele yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:1">Rev 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="REV 14:3">3</ref></char></note>san-karant-kat-mil, sele soti nan chak tribi a fis Israël yo.<verse eid="REV 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5"/>Nan tribi Juda a, douz-mil te sele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:5">nan tribi Ruben an, douz-mil, nan tribi Gad la, douz-mil,<verse eid="REV 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6"/>nan tribi Aser a, douz-mil, nan tribi Nephthali a, douz-mil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:6">nan tribi Manassé a, douz-mil,<verse eid="REV 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7"/>nan tribi Siméon an, douz-mil, nan tribi Levi a, douz-mil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:7">nan tribi Issacar a, douz-mil,<verse eid="REV 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8"/>nan tribi Zabulon an, douz-mil, nan tribi Joseph la, douz-mil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:8">nan tribi Benjamin an, douz-mil te sele.<verse eid="REV 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9"/>Apre bagay sa yo, mwen te gade, e vwala, yon gwo foul ke pèsòn pa t kapab konte, soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:9">Rev 5:9</ref></char></note>tout nasyon, tout tribi, pèp ak langaj, te kanpe devan twòn nan, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:3">Rev 22:3</ref></char></note>devan Jèn Mouton an ki te abiye an vètman blan, e branch palmis te nan men yo. <verse eid="REV 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10"/>Yo te kriye fò avèk yon gwo vwa, e t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 3:8">Sòm 3:8</ref></char></note>“Delivrans sòti nan Bondye nou an ki chita sou twòn nan, ak nan Jèn Mouton an.”<verse eid="REV 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11"/>Konsa, tout zanj yo te kanpe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:4">Rev 4:4</ref></char></note>toutotou de twòn nan, toutotou de lansyen yo, ak kat kreyati vivan yo. Yo te tonbe sou figi yo devan twòn nan pou adore Bondye. <verse eid="REV 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12"/>Yo t ap di: “Amen! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:12">Rev 5:12</ref></char></note>Benediksyon, laglwa, sajès, remèsiman, lonè, pwisans, e pouvwa pou Bondye nou an pou tout tan e pou tout tan! Amen.”<verse eid="REV 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13"/>Konsa, youn nan ansyen yo te reponn e t ap di mwen: “Sila ki abiye an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:9">Rev 7:9</ref></char></note>vètman blan yo, kilès yo ye, e ki kote yo sòti?”<verse eid="REV 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14"/>Mwen te di Li: “Senyè mwen, se Ou ki konnen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Epi li te di mwen: “Sa yo se sila ki sòti nan gran tribilasyon an, e yo te lave vètman yo pou fè vin blanch nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:14">Eb 9:14</ref></char></note>san a Jèn Mouton an. <verse eid="REV 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15"/>Pou rezon sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:9">Rev 7:9</ref></char></note>yo devan twòn Bondye a; epi yo sèvi Li lajounen kon lannwit nan tanp li an.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:15">“Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:9">Rev 4:9</ref></char></note>Sila ki chita nan twòn nan va ouvri tabènak li sou yo. <verse eid="REV 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 121:5">Sòm 121:5</ref></char></note>“Yo p ap grangou ankò, ni swaf ankò. Ni solèy la p ap bat yo, ni okenn chalè; <verse eid="REV 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17"/>paske, Jèn Mouton an nan mitan twòn nan va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:1">Sòm 23:1</ref></char></note>bèje pa yo. Li va gide yo a sous dlo vivan yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">És 25:8</ref></char></note>Bondye va seche tout dlo ki sòti nan zye yo.”<verse eid="REV 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1"/>Lè Jèn Mouton an te ouvri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:1">Rev 5:1</ref></char></note>setyèm so a, te gen silans nan syèl la pandan anviwon demi èdtan.<verse eid="REV 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2"/>Epi mwen te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:6-13">Rev 8:6-13</ref></char></note>sèt zanj ki kanpe devan Bondye, e yo te resevwa sèt twonpèt.<verse eid="REV 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3"/>Yon lòt zanj te vin kanpe devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:9">Rev 6:9</ref></char></note>lotèl la. Li te kenbe yon lansanswa an lò. Anpil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:8">Rev 5:8</ref></char></note>lansan te bay a li menm pou l ta kab ajoute sou lapriyè a tout sen ki te sou lotèl an lò ki te devan twòn nan. <verse eid="REV 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:1">Sòm 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 14:2">2</ref></char></note>lafimen lansan an avèk lapriyè a tout sen yo te sòti nan men a zanj lan pou monte parèt devan Bondye.<verse eid="REV 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5"/>Zanj lan te pran lansanswa a, li<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:12">Lev 16:12</ref></char></note>plen li avèk dife lotèl la, e voye l sou tè a. Sa te swiv ak gwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:16">Egz 19:16</ref></char></note>kout tonnè, gwo bri, kout eklè ak yon tranbleman detè. <verse eid="REV 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:2">Rev 8:2</ref></char></note>Konsa, sèt zanj ki te gen sèt twonpèt yo te prepare yo pou sone yo.<verse eid="REV 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7"/>Premye a te sone, epi te vin parèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:23">Egz 9:23</ref></char></note>lagrèl ak dife tou mele avèk san, e yo te jete yo sou tè a. Epi yon tyè pati tè a te brile, yon tyè nan pyebwa yo te brile e tout zèb vèt yo te brile nèt.<verse eid="REV 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8"/>Dezyèm zanj lan te sone, e yon bagay tankou yon gwo mòn k ap brile ak dife te jete nan lanmè a. Konsa yon tyè nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:17">Egz 7:17</ref></char></note>lanmè a te tounen san. <verse eid="REV 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9"/>Yon tyè nan kreyati vivan ki te nan lanmè yo te mouri, e yon tyè nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:16">És 2:16</ref></char></note>bato yo te detwi.<verse eid="REV 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10"/>Twazyèm zanj lan te sone, epi yon gwo zetwal ki t ap brile tankou yon tòch te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:12">És 14:12</ref></char></note>tonbe soti nan syèl la. Li te tonbe sou yon tyè nan larivyè ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:7">Rev 14:7</ref></char></note>sous dlo yo. <verse eid="REV 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11"/>Non a zetwal la se “Absinthe.” Yon tyè nan dlo yo te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:15">Jr 9:15</ref></char></note>anmè, e anpil moun te vin mouri akoz dlo yo ki te vin anmè a.<verse eid="REV 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12"/>Katriyèm zanj lan te sone, epi yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:21">Egz 10:21</ref></char></note>tyè nan solèy la, yon tyè nan lalin nan, ak yon tyè nan zetwal yo te frape, pouke yon tyè nan yo ta vin nwa, e jounen an pa ta parèt pandan yon tyè nan pati li, e lannwit lan, menm jan an.<verse eid="REV 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13"/>Answit, mwen te gade e mwen te tande yon èg k ap vole nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:6">Rev 14:6</ref></char></note>mitan syèl la, ki t ap di nan yon gwo vwa: “Malè! Malè! Malè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:10">Rev 3:10</ref></char></note>sila ki rete sou latè yo, akoz son twonpèt a twa zanj ki toujou rete yo!”<verse eid="REV 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1"/>Answit, senkyèm zanj lan te sone, e mwen te wè yon zetwal nan syèl la ki te tonbe sou tè a. Epi kle a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:31">Luc 8:31</ref></char></note>fòs labim nan te bay a li menm. <verse eid="REV 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2"/>Li te ouvri labim nan, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:28">Jen 19:28</ref></char></note>lafimen te sòti nan fòs la tankou lafimen a yon gwo founo. Solèy la avèk lè a te vin tounwa akoz lafimen ki sòti nan labim nan.<verse eid="REV 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 10:12-15">Egz 10:12-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Answit, krikèt te sòti nan lafimen an pou vini sou latè, epi yo te resevwa pouvwa, jan eskòpyon sou latè yo gen pouvwa a. <verse eid="REV 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4"/>Yo te di yo pou yo pa fè zèb latè yo mal, ni okenn bagay vèt, ni okenn pyebwa, men sèlman moun ki pa gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Éz 9:4</ref></char></note>so Bondye a parèt sou fon yo. <verse eid="REV 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5"/>Konsa, yo pa t pèmèt yo touye pèsòn, men toumante yo pandan senk mwa. Epi toumant yo te tankou toumant a yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 10:11">II Kwo 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 10:14">14</ref></char></note>eskòpyon lè l pike yon moun.<verse eid="REV 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6"/>Nan jou sa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 3:21">Job 3:21</ref></char></note>moun va cheche lanmò, e yo p ap twouve l. Yo va anvi mouri e lanmò va sove ale kite yo.<verse eid="REV 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7"/>Aparans a krikèt yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:4">Jl 2:4</ref></char></note>te tankou cheval ki prepare pou batay. Sou tèt yo te gen bagay tankou kouwòn an lò, e figi yo te tankou figi a moun. <verse eid="REV 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8"/>Yo te gen cheve ki te tankou cheve a fanm, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:6">Jl 1:6</ref></char></note>dan yo te tankou dan lyon. <verse eid="REV 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9"/>Yo te gen pwotèj lestonmak tankou pwotèj an fè, e bri a zèl yo te tankou bri cha a anpil cheval k ap kouri nan batay. <verse eid="REV 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10"/>Yo gen ke tankou eskòpyon, ak pikan. Epi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:19">Rev 9:19</ref></char></note>ke yo, te gen pouvwa pou fè moun mal pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:5">Rev 9:5</ref></char></note>senk mwa. <verse eid="REV 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11"/>Yo gen kòm wa sou yo, zanj <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:31">Luc 8:31</ref></char></note>labim nan. Non li an Ebre se Abaddon, e an Grèk, li rele Apollon.<verse eid="REV 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 8:13">Rev 8:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Premye malè a te gen tan fin pase. Gade byen, de malè ap toujou vini apre bagay sa yo.<verse eid="REV 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13"/>Answit, sizyèm zanj lan te sone. Mwen te tande yon vwa ki sòti nan kat kòn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:3">Rev 8:3</ref></char></note>lotèl an lò ki devan Bondye a. <verse eid="REV 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14"/>Youn t ap di a sizyèm zanj ki te gen twonpèt la: “Lage kat zanj ki mare bò kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18">Jen 15:18</ref></char></note>gwo Larivyè Euphrate la.”<verse eid="REV 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15"/>Epi kat zanj yo, ki te prepare ojis pou lè a, mwa a, jou ak lane a, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:7">Rev 20:7</ref></char></note>lage pou yo ta kapab touye yon tyè nan limanite. <verse eid="REV 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16"/>Kantite lame ki te sou cheval yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:11">Rev 5:11</ref></char></note>de-san-milyon. Mwen te tande kantite yo a.<verse eid="REV 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17"/>Konsa, mwen te wè nan vizyon an, cheval ak sila ki te chita sou yo a. Chevalye yo te gen pwotèj lestomak menm koulè ak dife, jasent, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:18">Rev 9:18</ref></char></note>souf, e tèt cheval yo tankou tèt lyon. E se dife, lafimen ak souf ki t ap sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:5">Rev 11:5</ref></char></note>nan bouch yo. <verse eid="REV 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18"/>Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:7">Rev 8:7</ref></char></note>tyè limanite te vin touye pa twa fleyo sa yo; pa dife, lafimen, ak souf ki t ap sòti nan bouch yo a. <verse eid="REV 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19"/>Paske pouvwa a cheval yo se nan bouch yo ak nan ke yo. Paske ke yo tankou sèpan e yo gen tèt; e avèk yo, yo fè mal yo.<verse eid="REV 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20"/>Rès limanite a ki pa t touye pa fleyo sa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:21">Rev 2:21</ref></char></note>pa t repanti de zèv a men yo, pou yo pa adore demon, ak zidòl an lò, an ajan, an bwonz, an wòch, ak bwa, ki pa kapab ni wè, ni tande, ni mache yo. <verse eid="REV 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21"/>Ni yo pa t repanti nan asasine moun, ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:9">És 47:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 47:12">12</ref></char></note>nan fè wanga, ni imoralite, ni vòl yo te fè yo.<verse eid="REV 9:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1"/>Mwen te wè yon lòt zanj byen fò ki t ap desann sòti nan syèl la, abiye avèk yon nwaj. Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:3">Rev 4:3</ref></char></note>lakansyèl la te sou tèt li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:2">Rev 17:2</ref></char></note>Figi li te tankou solèy la, e pye li yo tankou kolòn dife.<verse eid="REV 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2"/>Li te gen nan men l, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:1">Rev 5:1</ref></char></note>ti liv ki te louvri. Li te plase pye dwat li sou lanmè a e pye goch li sou tè a. <verse eid="REV 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3"/>Konsa, li te kriye avèk yon gwo vwa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 3:14">És 3:14</ref></char></note>tankou lè yon lyon gwonde. Epi lè l fin kriye fò, sèt kout tonnè yo te reponn ak vwa yo.<verse eid="REV 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4"/>Lè sèt kout tonnè yo te fin sonnen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:11-19">Rev 1:11-19</ref></char></note>mwen te prè pou ekri. Men mwen te tande yon vwa soti nan syèl la ki t ap di: “Sele bagay ke sèt kout tonnè yo te pale a. Pa ekri yo.”<verse eid="REV 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5"/>Answit, zanj ke m te wè kanpe sou lanmè ak sou tè a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:40">Det 32:40</ref></char></note>te leve men dwat li vè syèl la, <verse eid="REV 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6"/>e li te sèmante pa Sila ki vivan pou tout tan e pou tout tan an. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Egz 20:11</ref></char></note>Sila ki te kreye syèl la ak bagay ladann yo, tè a ak bagay ladann yo, e lanmè a ak bagay ladann yo, ke p ap gen reta ankò, <verse eid="REV 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7"/>men nan jou vwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:15">Rev 11:15</ref></char></note>setyèm zanj lan, lè li prè pou sone, alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 3:7">Am 3:7</ref></char></note>mistè a Bondye fini, jan Li te anonse a sèvitè Li yo, menm pwofèt yo.<verse eid="REV 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 10:4">Rev 10:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Answit, vwa ke m te tande nan syèl la, mwen te tande li te pale avè m ankò, e t ap di: “Ale pran liv ki ouvri a nan men a zanj ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 10:2">Rev 10:2</ref></char></note>kanpe sou lanmè a ak sou tè a”.<verse eid="REV 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9"/>Donk, mwen te ale kote zanj lan, pou di l ban mwen ti liv la. Li te di mwen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:16">Jr 15:16</ref></char></note>“Pran l, e manje l. L ap fè vant ou anmè, men nan bouch ou, l ap dous tankou siwo myèl.”<verse eid="REV 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10"/>Mwen te pran ti liv la nan men zanj lan, e mwen te manje l. Konsa, nan bouch mwen, li te dous tankou siwo myèl. Lè m te fin manje l, vant mwen te vin anmè.<verse eid="REV 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11"/>Konsa, yo te di mwen: “Ou oblije pwofetize ankò konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:9">Rev 5:9</ref></char></note>anpil pèp, nasyon, lang, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:10">Rev 17:10</ref>,<ref loc="REV 17:12">12</ref></char></note>wa.”<verse eid="REV 10:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1"/>Answit, yo te ban mwen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:3-42:20">Éz 40:3—42:20</ref></char></note>gòl pou mezire tankou yon baton, e youn te di: “Leve pou mezire tanp Bondye a, lotèl la ak sila ki adore ladann yo. <verse eid="REV 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2"/>Kite gran lakou ki deyò tanp lan. Pa mezire l, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:24">Luc 21:24</ref></char></note>li te bay a nasyon yo. Konsa, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:25">Dan 7:25</ref></char></note>foule vil sen an anba pye yo pandan karant-de mwa.<verse eid="REV 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3"/>“Mwen va bay otorite a de temwen mwen yo, e yo va pwofetize pandan mil-de-san-swasant jou abiye avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:34">Jen 37:34</ref></char></note>twal sak.” <verse eid="REV 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4"/>Sa yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:3">Za 4:3</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 4:11">11</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 4:14">14</ref></char></note>de pye doliv ak de chandelye ki kanpe devan Senyè latè a. <verse eid="REV 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5"/>Si yon moun vle fè yo mal, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:10-12">II Wa 1:10-12</ref></char></note>dife va sòti nan bouch yo pou devore lènmi yo. Donk si yon moun vle fè yo mal, li dwe vin touye nan fason sa a. <verse eid="REV 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6"/>Sa yo gen pouvwa pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">I Wa 17:1</ref></char></note>fèmen syèl la pou lapli pa tonbe pandan jou pwofesi yo a. Yo gen pouvwa sou dlo pou fè yo tounen san, e pou frape latè avèk tout kalite fleyo, nenpòt lè yo ta vle. <verse eid="REV 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7"/>Lè yo fini temwayaj yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:1">Rev 13:1</ref></char></note>bèt ki sòti nan labim nan va fè lagè avèk yo e venk yo pou touye yo. <verse eid="REV 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8"/>Konsa, kadav yo va rete nan lari gran vil ki nan lespri a yo rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">És 1:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 1:10">10</ref></char></note>Sodome e Égypte la, kote osi Senyè yo a te krisifye a.<verse eid="REV 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9"/>Sila ki soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:9">Rev 5:9</ref></char></note>pèp yo, tribi yo, lang ak nasyon yo va gade kadav pa yo pandan twa jou edmi, e li p ap pèmèt pou kadav yo mete nan tonbo. <verse eid="REV 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:10">Rev 3:10</ref></char></note>Epi sila ki rete sou latè yo va rejwi sou yo, e fete. Yo va voye kado bay youn lòt, paske de pwofèt sa yo te toumante sila ki rete sou latè yo.<verse eid="REV 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11"/>Men apre twa jou edmi yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:5">Éz 37:5</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 37:9">9</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 37:10">10</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 37:14">14</ref></char></note>souf lavi soti nan Bondye te vini sou yo, yo te kanpe sou pye yo, e gwo laperèz te vin tonbe sou tout sila ki t ap gade yo. <verse eid="REV 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12"/>Epi yo te tande yon gwo vwa nan syèl la ki t ap di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:1">Rev 4:1</ref></char></note>“Vin monte isit la.” Konsa yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:11">II Wa 2:11</ref></char></note>monte nan syèl la nan nwaj la, e menm lènmi yo te gade yo.<verse eid="REV 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13"/>Epi nan lè sa a, te gen yon gwo tranbleman detè, e yon dizyèm pati nan vil la te tonbe. Sèt-mil moun te mouri nan tranbleman detè a, e rès moun yo te vin ranpli avèk laperèz e te bay glwa a Bondye syèl la.<verse eid="REV 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14"/>Dezyèm malè a gen tan pase. Gade byen, twazyèm malè a ap vini byen vit.<verse eid="REV 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15"/>Answit, setyèm zanj lan te sone, epi te gen gwo vwa yo nan syèl la ki t ap di: “Wayòm mond sa a gen tan devni wayòm a Senyè nou an, ak Kris Li a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:18">Egz 15:18</ref></char></note>Li va renye pou tout tan e pou tout tan!”<verse eid="REV 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16"/>Venn-kat ansyen yo, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat 19:28</ref></char></note>chita sou twòn pa yo devan Bondye, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:10">Rev 4:10</ref></char></note>tonbe sou figi yo pou adore Bondye. <verse eid="REV 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17"/>E yo t ap di: “Nou ba Ou remèsiman, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:8">Rev 1:8</ref></char></note>O Senyè, Bondye, Toupwisan an, ki la e ki te la, paske Ou te pran pwisans ou a, e ou te kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:6">Rev 19:6</ref></char></note>renye.<verse eid="REV 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:1">Sòm 2:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Nasyon yo te vin anraje e kòlè Ou te vin parèt. Lè a te vin rive pou mò yo vin jije e pou rekonpanse sèvitè Ou yo, pwofèt yo, sen yo, ak sila ki gen lakrent pou non Ou yo, piti kou gran, e pou detwi sila ki detwi latè yo.”<verse eid="REV 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 15:5">Rev 15:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Epi tanp Bondye ki nan syèl la te vin louvri e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:4">Eb 9:4</ref></char></note>lach akò Li a te parèt nan tanp Li a. Konsa, te gen kout eklè, bri, gwo kout tonnè, yon tranbleman detè, ak gwo tanpèt lagrèl.<verse eid="REV 11:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1"/>Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mat 24:30</ref></char></note>gwo sign te vin parèt nan syèl la: yon fanm abiye avèk solèy la, ak lalin nan anba pye li, e sou tèt li, yon kouwòn douz etwal. <verse eid="REV 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2"/>Li te gwo ansent e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:17">És 26:17</ref></char></note>kriye fò ak tranche ak doulè pou l akouche.<verse eid="REV 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3"/>Answit, yon lòt sign te parèt nan syèl la. Gade byen, yon gwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:1">És 27:1</ref></char></note>dragon wouj avèk sèt tèt ak dis kòn, e sou tèt li yo te gen sèt kouwòn. <verse eid="REV 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4"/>Konsa, ke li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:7">Rev 8:7</ref>,<ref loc="REV 8:12">12</ref></char></note>baleye nèt yon tyè nan zetwal nan syèl yo e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:10">Dan 8:10</ref></char></note>jete yo sou latè.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 12:4">Dragon an te kanpe devan fanm ki te prèt pou akouche a, pou lè li fè pitit la, li ta kab devore pitit li a. <verse eid="REV 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:7">És 66:7</ref></char></note>Konsa, li te fè yon fis, yon pitit mal, ki gen pou gouvène tout nasyon yo avèk yon baton fè. Pitit li a te rale monte kote Bondye, e anvè twòn Li an. <verse eid="REV 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6"/>Answit fanm nan te sove ale nan dezè a kote li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:3">Rev 11:3</ref></char></note>gen yon plas prepare pa Bondye, pouke la, li ta kapab nouri pandan mil-de-san-swasann jou.<verse eid="REV 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7"/>Epi te gen lagè nan syèl la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Dan 10:13</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref></char></note>Michel avèk zanj li yo t ap fè lagè avèk dragon an. Dragon an avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:41">Mat 25:41</ref></char></note>zanj pa li yo t ap fè lagè. <verse eid="REV 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8"/>Men yo pa t reyisi genyen. Konsa, yo pa t jwenn plas ankò nan syèl la. <verse eid="REV 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9"/>Gran dragon an te jete anba; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Jen 3:1</ref></char></note>sèpan ansyen an ki rele dyab la ak Satan, ki twonpe tout mond lan. Li te jete anba sou latè, e zanj li yo te jete anba avèk li.<verse eid="REV 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10"/>Answit mwen te tande yon gwo vwa nan syèl la ki t ap di: “Koulye a delivrans lan, pwisans lan, wayòm Bondye nou an, ak otorite Kris Li a te vini an. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:11">Job 1:11</ref></char></note>akizatè a frè nou yo jete anba; Sila ki te konn akize yo devan Bondye nou an lajounen kon lannwit lan. <verse eid="REV 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11"/>Yo te venk li akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:14">Rev 7:14</ref></char></note>san Jèn Mouton an e akoz pawòl temwayaj yo. Konsa, yo pa t renmen lavi yo, menm fas a lanmò.<verse eid="REV 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12"/>“Pou rezon sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 96:11">Sòm 96:11</ref></char></note>rejwi nou o syèl, ak nou menm ki demere ladann yo. Malè a tè a ak lanmè a paske dyab la gen tan desann sou nou avèk gwo kòlè, akoz li konnen tan li an vrèman kout.”<verse eid="REV 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13"/>Alò, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:3">Rev 12:3</ref></char></note>dragon an te wè ke li te jete anba sou latè, li te pèsekite fanm ki te bay nesans a pitit mal la.<verse eid="REV 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:4">Egz 19:4</ref></char></note>de zèl a gwo èg la te bay a fanm nan pou li ta kapab vole rive nan dezè a nan pwòp plas li, kote li te nouri pandan yon ti tan, tan ak mwatye tan, lib de prezans sèpan an.<verse eid="REV 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Jen 3:1</ref></char></note>sèpan an te vide yon dlo sòti nan bouch li tankou yon rivyè dèyè fanm nan, pou li ta kapab baleye l avèk lavalas dlo. <verse eid="REV 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16"/>Men tè a te ede fanm nan. Tè a te louvri bouch li e te bwè tout larivyè dlo ke dragon an te vide soti nan bouch li a. <verse eid="REV 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17"/>Donk, dragon a te vin anraje avèk fanm nan. Konsa, li te ale pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:7">Rev 11:7</ref></char></note>fè lagè avèk rès pitit li yo ki kenbe kòmandman Bondye yo, e ki kenbe temwayaj a Jésus a.<verse eid="REV 12:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1"/>Dragon an te kanpe sou sab lanmè a. Mwen te wè yon bèt ki sòti nan lanmè a, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:3">Rev 12:3</ref></char></note>dis kòn, ak sèt tèt. Sou kòn li yo, te gen dis kouwòn, e sou tèt li te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:8">Dan 7:8</ref></char></note>non blasfematè yo. <verse eid="REV 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2"/>Bèt ke m te wè a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:6">Dan 7:6</ref></char></note>tankou yon leyopa. Pat li yo te tankou pat a yon lous, e bouch li te tankou bouch a yon lyon. Konsa, dragon an te ba li pouvwa li a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:13">Rev 2:13</ref></char></note>twòn li an, ak gran otorite. <verse eid="REV 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3"/>Mwen te wè youn nan tèt li yo kòmsi li te fin touye, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:12">Rev 13:12</ref>,<ref loc="REV 13:14">14</ref></char></note>blese fatal li a te fin geri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 13:3">Tout latè te etone, e yo te swiv bèt la. <verse eid="REV 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4"/>Yo te adore <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:3">Rev 12:3</ref></char></note>dragon an paske li te bay otorite a bèt la, epi yo te adore bèt la. Yo t ap di: “Kilès ki tankou bèt la, e kilès ki kapab fè lagè avè l?”<verse eid="REV 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5"/>Li te resevwa yon bouch pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:25">Dan 7:25</ref></char></note>pale pawòl ki awogan yo avèk blasfèm, e li te resevwa otorite pou aji pandan karant-de mwa. <verse eid="REV 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6"/>Li te ouvri bouch li ak blasfèm yo kont Bondye, pou blasfeme non Li ak tabènak Li a, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:15">Rev 7:15</ref></char></note>sila ki rete nan syèl yo. <verse eid="REV 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7"/>Pouvwa a te osi bay a li menm pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:21">Dan 7:21</ref></char></note>fè lagè avèk sen yo, e pou venk yo. Epi otorite sou chak tribi, pèp, lang, ak nasyon, te vin bay a li menm.<verse eid="REV 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8"/>Tout moun ki viv sou tè a va adore l, tout moun ke non yo pa ekri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:8">Rev 17:8</ref></char></note>depi nan fondasyon mond lan, nan liv lavi a Jèn Mouton ki te touye a.<verse eid="REV 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 2:7">Rev 2:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Si yon moun gen yon zorèy, kite l tande. <verse eid="REV 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Jr 15:2</ref></char></note>Si yon moun gen pou ale an kaptivite, an kaptivite li prale. Si yon moun dwe touye avèk nepe, avèk nepe, li va touye. Se konsa ak lafwa ak pèseverans a sen yo.<verse eid="REV 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 13:1">Rev 13:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Answit, mwen te wè yon lòt bèt ki t ap vin sòti anba tè a. Li te gen de kòn tankou yon jenn mouton, e li te pale tankou yon dragon.<verse eid="REV 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12"/>Li egzèse tout otorite a premye bèt la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:14">Rev 13:14</ref></char></note>nan prezans li. Epi li fè tè a avèk sila ki rete ladann yo adore premye bèt, ki te gen blese fatal ki te geri a. <verse eid="REV 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13"/>Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mat 24:24</ref></char></note> fè gwo sign, jis pou fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:38">I Wa 18:38</ref></char></note>dife sòti nan syèl la rive sou tè a devan prezans a moun yo. <verse eid="REV 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14"/>E li twonpe sila ki viv sou latè yo, akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:9">II Tes 2:9</ref></char></note>gwo sign ki te bay a li menm pou fè nan prezans a bèt la. Li pale ak sila ki viv sou latè yo pou yo fè yon imaj a bèt ki te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:3">Rev 13:3</ref></char></note>blese nepe a, e ki te viv.<verse eid="REV 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15"/>Konsa, pouvwa a te bay a li menm pou bay souf a imaj bèt la, pou imaj a bèt la ta kapab menm pale e fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:3">Dan 3:3</ref></char></note>tout sila ki refize adore bèt la touye. <verse eid="REV 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16"/>Konsa, li koze tout moun, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:18">Rev 11:18</ref></char></note>piti kon gran, rich kon malere, moun lib kon esklav, vin resevwa yon mak sou men dwat oswa sou fon yo, <verse eid="REV 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17"/>pou pèsòn pa kapab ni achte ni vann, eksepte sila ki pote mak la, ki se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:11">Rev 14:11</ref></char></note> non a bèt la oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:2">Rev 15:2</ref></char></note>chif non li an.<verse eid="REV 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 17:9">Rev 17:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Men sajès. Kite sila ki gen bon konprann nan, kalkile chif a bèt la, paske chif la se sa ki pou yon moun. E chif li a se sis-san-swasann-sis.<verse eid="REV 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1"/>Answit, mwen te gade! Vwala, Jèn Mouton an te kanpe sou Mòn Sion. Ansanm avèk li, te gen san-karant-kat-mil, ki pote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:2">Rev 3:2</ref></char></note>non L ak non a Papa Li, ekri sou fon yo.<verse eid="REV 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2"/>Mwen te tande yon son soti nan syèl la, tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:15">Rev 1:15</ref></char></note>son anpil dlo ak son a gwo kout tonnè. Vwa ke m tande a te tankou sila k ap jwe ap yo. <verse eid="REV 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3"/>Epi yo te chante <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:9">Rev 5:9</ref></char></note>yon chan tounèf devan twòn nan, devan kat kreyati vivan yo ak ansyen yo. E pèsòn pa t kapab aprann chan an, eksepte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:4">Rev 7:4</ref></char></note> san-karant-kat-mil ki te achte, soti sou tè a. <verse eid="REV 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4"/>Sa yo se sila ki pa t souye pa fanm yo, paske se vyèj yo ye. Sa yo se sila ki swiv Jèn Mouton an tout kote Li ale. Sa yo te achte pami lòm kòm premye fwi pou Bondye, e pou Jèn Mouton an. <verse eid="REV 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:2">Sòm 2:2</ref></char></note>manti pa t twouve nan bouch yo; yo te san repwòch.<verse eid="REV 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6"/>Epi mwen te wè yon lòt zanj ki t ap vole nan mitan syèl la, avèk yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:25">I Pi 1:25</ref></char></note>levanjil etènèl pou preche a sila ki viv sou latè yo, a tout nasyon, tribi, langaj, ak pèp.<verse eid="REV 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7"/>Konsa, li te di avèk yon vwa fò: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:4">Rev 15:4</ref></char></note>“Gen lakrent pou Bondye, e ba Li glwa, paske lè jijman Li an gen tan vini. Adore Sila ki te fè syèl la, tè a, lanmè a, ak sous dlo yo.”<verse eid="REV 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8"/>Yon lòt zanj, yon dezyèm, te swiv, e t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:9">És 21:9</ref></char></note>“Tonbe, tonbe, gran Babylone nan, Sila ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:7">Jr 51:7</ref></char></note>fè tout nasyon yo bwè diven pasyon imoralite li a.”<verse eid="REV 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9"/>Answit, yon lòt zanj, yon twazyèm, te swiv yo e t ap di avèk yon vwa ki fò: “Si yon moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:12">Rev 13:12</ref></char></note>adore bèt la avèk limaj li a, e resevwa yon mak sou fon li oubyen sou men l, <verse eid="REV 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10"/>li osi va bwè nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">És 51:17</ref></char></note>diven kòlè Bondye a, ki melanje nèt nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 75:8">Sòm 75:8</ref></char></note>tas kòlè Li a. Konsa, li va toumante avèk dife ak souf nan prezans a zanj sen yo, ak nan prezans a Jèn Mouton an. <verse eid="REV 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:8-10">És 34:8-10</ref></char></note>Lafimen toumant yo ap monte pou tout tan e pou tout tan. Yo p ap gen repo ni lajounen ni lannwit, sila yo ki adore bèt la avèk imaj li a, ak nenpòt moun ki resevwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:17">Rev 13:17</ref></char></note>mak non li an.<verse eid="REV 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12"/>Men isit, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:10">Rev 13:10</ref></char></note>pèseverans a sen ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:17">Rev 12:17</ref></char></note>kenbe kòmandman Bondye yo avèk lafwa yo nan Jésus.<verse eid="REV 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13"/>“Mwen te tande yon vwa ki sòti nan syèl la ki t ap di: “Ekri, ‘Beni se mò ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:16">I Tes 4:16</ref></char></note>mouri nan Senyè a depi koulye a!’”:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">“Wi”, di Lespri a, “pou yo kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:9">Eb 4:9</ref></char></note>repoze de travay yo, paske zèv pa yo ap swiv yo.”<verse eid="REV 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14"/>Answit, mwen te gade, e vwala, yon nwaj blan, epi chita sou nwaj la, se yon moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref></char></note>tankou yon fis a Lòm, avèk yon kouwòn an lò sou tèt li ak yon kouto digo byen file nan men li.<verse eid="REV 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15"/>Konsa, yon lòt zanj te vini sòti nan tanp lan, e t ap kriye nan yon vwa fò a Sila ki te chita sou nwaj la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Jl 3:13</ref></char></note>“Mete kouto digo a ladann pou rekòlte, paske lè rekòlt la rive. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:39-41">Mat 13:39-41</ref></char></note>Mwason latè a mi.”<verse eid="REV 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16"/>Answit, Sila ki te chita sou nwaj la te voye kouto digo a sou sifas tè a, epi tè a te rekòlte.<verse eid="REV 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17"/>Yon lòt zanj <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:19">Rev 11:19</ref></char></note>te sòti nan tanp ki nan syèl la, e li menm tou te gen yon kouto digo byen file.<verse eid="REV 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18"/>Konsa, yon lòt zanj ankò, sila ki gen pouvwa sou dife a, te sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:9">Rev 6:9</ref></char></note>lotèl la. Li te rele avèk yon vwa fò a sila ki te gen kouto digo file a. Li te di: “Mete kouto digo file ou ladann. Ranmase grap sou pye rezen latè yo, paske fwi li yo mi.”<verse eid="REV 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19"/>Zanj lan te voye kouto digo li a sou tè a. Li te ranmase grap sou pye rezen tè yo, e te jete yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:2">És 63:2</ref></char></note>gwo pèz diven kòlè Bondye a. <verse eid="REV 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:3">És 63:3</ref></char></note>basen pèz diven an te foule anba pye deyò vil la, e san te sòti nan pèz diven an, rive nan brid cheval la pou yon distans de twa-san kilomèt.<verse eid="REV 14:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1"/>Konsa, mwen te wè yon lòt sign nan syèl la, gran e mèvèye: sèt zanj ki te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:21">Lev 26:21</ref></char></note>sèt fleyo, ki se dènye yo, paske nan yo, kòlè Bondye a fini.<verse eid="REV 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2"/>Mwen te wè yon bagay tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:6">Rev 4:6</ref></char></note>lanmè fèt ak vit mele avèk dife, e moun sila yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:11">Rev 12:11</ref></char></note>ki te gen viktwa sou bèt la, imaj li a ak chif a non li an, te kanpe sou lanmè fèt ak vit la. Yo t ap kenbe ap Bondye yo.<verse eid="REV 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3"/>Konsa, yo te chante <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:1">Egz 15:1</ref></char></note>chan a Moïse la, sèvitè a Bondye a, ak chan a Jèn Mouton an. Yo t ap di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:3">Det 32:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Gran e mèvèye, se zèv Ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">O Senyè, Bondye Toupwisan an!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Jis e vrè, se chemen Ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Wa a nasyon yo.<verse eid="REV 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4"/>Kilès ki p ap krent Ou, O Senyè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">epi bay glwa a non Ou?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Paske se Ou sèl ki sen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 86:9">Sòm 86:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Paske tout nasyon yo va vini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">pou adore devan Ou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Paske zèv ladwati Ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Ou gen tan revele.”<verse eid="REV 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5"/>Apre bagay sa yo, mwen te gade, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:19">Rev 11:19</ref></char></note>tanp tabènak temwayaj ki nan syèl la te vin louvri. <verse eid="REV 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:1">Rev 15:1</ref></char></note>sèt zanj ki te gen sèt fleyo yo te vin sòti nan tanp lan, abiye an lèn san tach e briyan, e yo te antoure lestomak yo avèk senti an lò.<verse eid="REV 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7"/>Answit, youn nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:6">Rev 4:6</ref></char></note>kat kreyati vivan yo te bay a sèt zanj yo sèt gode an lò, plen ak kòlè Bondye, ki viv pou tout tan e pou tout tan.<verse eid="REV 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8"/>Epi tanp lan te vin ranpli avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:18">Egz 19:18</ref></char></note>lafimen laglwa Bondye ak pwisans li. Okenn moun pa t kapab antre nan tanp lan jiskaske sèt fleyo a sèt zanj yo te fini.<verse eid="REV 15:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1"/>Konsa, mwen te tande yon gwo vwa sòti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:19">Rev 11:19</ref></char></note>tanp lan ki t ap di a sèt zanj yo: “Ale vide sèt gode kòlè Bondye yo sou tè a.”<verse eid="REV 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2"/>Donk, premye zanj lan te ale vide gode li a sou tè a. Konsa, li te devni yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:9-11">Egz 9:9-11</ref></char></note>maleng rayisab sou moun ki te pote mak a bèt la e ki te adore imaj li a.<verse eid="REV 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3"/>Dezyèm zanj lan te vide gode li a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:17-21">Egz 7:17-21</ref></char></note>nan lanmè a, e li te devni san tankou san a yon moun mouri. Konsa, tout bagay vivan nan lanmè a te mouri.<verse eid="REV 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4"/>Answit, twazyèm zanj lan te vide gode li a nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:10">Rev 8:10</ref></char></note>rivyè ak sous dlo yo, e yo te tounen san. <verse eid="REV 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5"/>Mwen te tande zanj a dlo yo k ap di: “<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:25">Jn 17:25</ref></char></note>Jis se Ou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:17">Rev 11:17</ref></char></note>ki la e ki te la a, O Sila Ki Sen an, paske Ou te jije bagay sa yo. <verse eid="REV 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6"/>Paske sila yo te vèse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:6">Rev 17:6</ref></char></note>san a sen ak pwofèt yo, e Ou te bay yo san pou yo bwè. Yo merite sa.”<verse eid="REV 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7"/>Konsa, mwen te tande lotèl la ki t ap di: “Wi, O Bondye Senyè, Sila Ki Toupwisan an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:3">Rev 15:3</ref></char></note>vrè e jis se jijman Ou yo.”<verse eid="REV 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8"/>Katriyèm zanj lan te vide gode li a sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:12">Rev 6:12</ref></char></note>solèy la, epi li te bay a li menm pou chode moun avèk dife. <verse eid="REV 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9"/>Moun yo te chode avèk yon chalè. Konsa, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:11">Rev 16:11</ref>,<ref loc="REV 16:21">21</ref></char></note>blasfeme non Bondye ki gen pouvwa sou fleyo sa yo, men yo pa t repanti pou ta ba Li glwa.<verse eid="REV 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10"/>Answit, senkyèm zanj lan te vide gode li sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:2">Rev 13:2</ref></char></note>twòn a bèt la, epi wayòm li an te vin tounwa. Konsa, yo te manje pwòp lang yo akoz de doulè a. <verse eid="REV 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11"/>Yo te blasfeme Bondye syèl la, akoz de doulè ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:2">Rev 16:2</ref></char></note>maleng yo. Malgre sa a, yo pa t repanti de zèv yo.<verse eid="REV 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12"/>Sizyèm zanj lan te vide gode li a sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 9:14">Rev 9:14</ref></char></note>gran rivyè Euphrate la. Dlo li te vin seche, pou chemen an ta kapab prepare pou wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:2">Rev 7:2</ref></char></note>ki sòti nan lès yo.<verse eid="REV 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13"/>Konsa, mwen te wè sòti nan bouch a dragon an, sòti nan bouch a bèt la, e sòti nan bouch a fo pwofèt la, twa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:2">Rev 18:2</ref></char></note>lespri sal tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 8:6">Egz 8:6</ref></char></note>krapo. <verse eid="REV 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14"/>Se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:1">I Tim 4:1</ref></char></note>lespri a demon yo, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:13">Rev 13:13</ref></char></note>t ap fè sign yo pou parèt bò kote wa a tout mond yo, pou rasanble yo ansanm pou lagè a gran jou Bondye, Toupwisan an.<verse eid="REV 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Gade byen,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat 24:43</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen ap vini tankou yon vòlè. Beni se sila ki rete vijilan an, e ki kenbe vètman li, pou li pa vin mache toupatou toutouni, pou moun pa wè wont li.” </char><verse eid="REV 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16"/>Konsa, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:19">Rev 19:19</ref></char></note>rasanble ansanm kote ki, an Ebre, yo rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:11">Za 4:11</ref></char></note>Harmaguédon an.<verse eid="REV 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17"/>Answit, setyèm zanj lan te vide gode li anlè. Yon gwo vwa te sòti nan tanp lan bò kote twòn nan. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 10:6">Rev 10:6</ref></char></note>“Sa fin fèt.”<verse eid="REV 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18"/>Te gen kout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:5">Rev 4:5</ref></char></note>eklè, gwo bri ak gwo kout tonnè. Konsa te fèt yon gwo tranbleman detè, tankou pa t janm genyen depi lòm te vini sou latè, tèlman tranbleman detè a te gran e pwisan.<verse eid="REV 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19"/>Gran vil la te fann an twa pati, e gran vil a nasyon yo te tonbe. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:8">Rev 14:8</ref></char></note>Babylone le gran te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:5">Rev 18:5</ref></char></note>sonje devan Bondye, pou Li ba li gode diven de kòlè vyolan Li a.<verse eid="REV 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 6:14">Rev 6:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tout lil yo te sove ale, e mòn yo pa t kab twouve.<verse eid="REV 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21"/>Gwo bòl lagrèl chak te peze anviwon san liv, te desann sòti nan syèl la tonbe sou moun. Pou sa a, moun te blasfeme Bondye akoz de<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:18-25">Egz 9:18-25</ref></char></note>fleyo lagrèl la, paske fleyo li a te ekstrèmman grav.<verse eid="REV 16:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1"/>Youn nan sèt zanj ki te gen sèt gode yo te vini. Li te pale avè m e te di: “Vini isit la! Mwen va montre ou jijman a gran pwostitiye ki chita sou anpil dlo yo, <verse eid="REV 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2"/>avèk sila a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:22">Rev 2:22</ref></char></note>wa latè yo a te vin komèt zak imoralite. Tout sila ki demere sou latè yo te fè vin sou avèk diven imoralite li a.”<verse eid="REV 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 21:10">Rev 21:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li te pote mwen lwen nan Lespri a nan yon dezè. Mwen te wè yon fanm ki te chita sou yon bèt wouj, plen ak non blasfèm, ki te gen sèt tèt ak dis kòn. <verse eid="REV 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4"/>Fanm nan te abiye an mov ak wouj, e te dekore avèk lò, pyè presye, ak pèl. Nan men l, li te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:7">Jr 51:7</ref></char></note>yon gode an lò, ranpli ak abominasyon, de tout bagay sal de imoralite li yo. <verse eid="REV 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5"/>Sou fon li, te ekri yon non: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:7">II Tes 2:7</ref></char></note>MISTÈ: “BABALONE LE GRAN, MANMAN A PWOSTITIYE AK ABOMINASYON SOU LATÈ YO”.<verse eid="REV 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6"/>Konsa, mwen te wè fanm nan sou avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:6">Rev 16:6</ref></char></note>san a sen yo, e avèk san a temwen Jésus yo. Lè mwen te wè l, mwen te etone anpil.<verse eid="REV 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7"/>Zanj lan te di mwen: “Poukisa ou etone? Mwen va di ou mistè a fanm nan ak bèt ki pote li a, sila ki gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:3">Rev 17:3</ref></char></note>sèt tèt ak dis kòn yo. <verse eid="REV 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8"/>Bèt ke ou te wè, li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:7">Rev 11:7</ref></char></note>te ye a, li pa la, e li prè pou sòti nan labim nan pou ale nan destriksyon. Epi sila ki rete sou latè yo, ke non yo pa ekri nan liv lavi a depi nan fondasyon mond lan, va etone lè yo wè bèt la jan li te ye, jan li pa la, ak jan li va vini an.<verse eid="REV 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9"/>“Men panse ki gen sajès la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 10:11">Rev 10:11</ref></char></note>Sèt tèt yo se sèt mòn kote fanm nan chita yo. <verse eid="REV 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10"/>Yo se sèt wa. Senk te tonbe, youn la toujou, e lòt la poko vini, epi lè l vini, li dwe rete pou yon ti tan. <verse eid="REV 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11"/>Bèt ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:3">Rev 13:3</ref>,<ref loc="REV 13:12">12</ref>,<ref loc="REV 13:14">14</ref></char></note>te ye a, e ki pa la a, li se yon uityèm tou, e youn nan sèt yo. L ap wale nan destriksyon.<verse eid="REV 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 7:24">Dan 7:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Dis kòn ke ou te wè yo, se dis wa ki poko janm resevwa wayòm yo, men yo resevwa otorite tankou wa, ansanm avèk bèt la pandan yon èdtan. <verse eid="REV 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13"/>Sa yo gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:17">Rev 17:17</ref></char></note>yon sèl bi, e yo va bay pouvwa yo ak otorite a bèt la. <verse eid="REV 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14"/>Sila yo va fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:14">Rev 16:14</ref></char></note>lagè kont Jèn Mouton an, e Jèn Mouton an va venk yo, paske Li se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:15">I Tim 6:15</ref></char></note>Senyè dè senyè e Wadèwa. Konsa, sila ki avè l yo se sila ki gen apèl, ki chwazi e ki fidèl.<verse eid="REV 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15"/>“Ankò, li te di mwen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:7">És 8:7</ref></char></note>“Dlo ke ou te wè, kote pwostitiye a chita a, se pèp yo, foul yo, nasyon yo, ak lang yo. <verse eid="REV 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:12">Rev 17:12</ref></char></note>Epi dis kòn ke ou te wè yo, ansanm ak bèt la, sa yo va rayi pwostitiye a e yo va fè l vin dezole, e toutouni, epi yo va manje chè li e brile li avèk dife.<verse eid="REV 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17"/>“Paske Bondye te mete nan kè yo pou fè volonte L avèk bi ke yo gen ansanm nan, e pou donnen wayòm pa yo a bèt la, jiskaske pawòl Bondye yo ta vin akonpli.<verse eid="REV 17:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18"/>“Fanm ke ou te wè a se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:8">Rev 11:8</ref></char></note>gran vil la, ki renye sou wa latè yo.”<verse eid="REV 17:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1"/>Apre bagay sa yo, mwen te wè yon lòt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:1">Rev 17:1</ref>,<ref loc="REV 17:7">7</ref></char></note>zanj k ap desann sòti nan syèl la, avèk gwo otorite, e tè a te byen klere avèk glwa li. <verse eid="REV 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2"/>Epi li te kriye avèk yon gwo vwa, e t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:9">És 21:9</ref></char></note>“Tonbe, tonbe, se Babylone Le Gran! Li gen tan vini yon kote pou dyab rete, ak yon prizon pou tout kalite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:3">Rev 16:3</ref></char></note>lespri sal, e yon prizon pou tout kalite zwazo sal e abominab. <verse eid="REV 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3"/>Paske tout nasyon yo te bwè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:7">Jr 51:7</ref></char></note>diven a pasyon imoralite li a, wa latè yo te komèt zak imoralite avè l, e machann latè yo te vin rich avèk richès sansyalite li yo.”<verse eid="REV 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4"/>Mwen te tande yon lòt vwa soti nan syèl la ki t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">És 52:11</ref></char></note>“Sòti kite li, pèp mwen an, pou nou pa patisipe nan peche li yo e resevwa fleyo li yo. <verse eid="REV 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5"/>Paske peche li yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:9">Jr 51:9</ref></char></note>anpile vin menm wotè ak syèl la, e Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:19">Rev 16:19</ref></char></note>sonje tout inikite li yo. <verse eid="REV 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 137:8">Sòm 137:8</ref></char></note>Remèt li menm jan li te bay la, e ba li anretou de fwa selon zèv li yo. Nan gode ke li te fè melanj lan, fè melanj lan otan de fwa pou li. <verse eid="REV 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7"/>Nan degre ke li te bay tèt li glwa a e viv nan sansyalite a, nan menm degre a, toumante l, e ba li doulè. Paske li di nan kè li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:7">És 47:7</ref></char></note>“Mwen chita tankou yon rèn, mwen pa yon vèv, mwen p ap janm wè doulè.” <verse eid="REV 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8"/>Pou rezon sa a, nan yon jou, fleyo li yo va vini; lapès, lapèn ak gwo grangou. E li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:16">Rev 17:16</ref></char></note>brile avèk dife, paske Senyè Bondye ki jije li a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:17">Rev 11:17</ref></char></note>pwisan.<verse eid="REV 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9"/>“Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:2">Rev 17:2</ref></char></note>wa latè yo ki te komèt zak imoralite e ki te viv selon lachè avè l yo, va kriye e lamante sou li lè yo wè lafimen monte pandan l ap brile a. <verse eid="REV 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:15">Rev 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="REV 18:17">17</ref></char></note>Y ap kanpe a yon distans akoz de pè a toumant li an, e y ap di:” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:16">Rev 18:16</ref>,<ref loc="REV 18:19">19</ref></char></note>‘Malè, malè, gran vil, Babylone nan, vil ki fò a! Paske, nan yon èdtan, jijman ou gen tan rive.’<verse eid="REV 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11"/>“Konsa, machann latè yo kriye e lamante sou li paske pèsòn pa achte machandiz yo ankò. <verse eid="REV 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12"/>Machandiz lò, ajan, pyè presye, pèl, ak lèn fen, koulè mov, twal swa, wouj, tout kalite bwa sitwon ak tout kalite ivwa, tout atik ki fèt ak bwa ki koute chè, bwonz, fè, ak wòch mab. <verse eid="REV 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13"/>Epi kanèl, epis, lansan, pafen, lwil doliv, farin fen, ble, bèf, mouton, ak kago bato cheval, cha, esklav, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:21">I Kwo 5:21</ref></char></note>lavi moun.<verse eid="REV 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14"/>“Fwi nou anvi yo disparèt, tout bagay ki te swa, chè oswa ekstrawòdinè yo te pase kite nou e moun p ap twouve yo ankò. <verse eid="REV 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:3">Rev 18:3</ref></char></note>Machann a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:12">Rev 18:12</ref>,<ref loc="REV 18:13">13</ref></char></note>bagay sa yo, ki te vin rich akoz gran vil sa a va kanpe a yon distans akoz perèz toumant li an, yo va kriye e lamante. <verse eid="REV 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16"/>Yo va di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:10">Rev 18:10</ref>,<ref loc="REV 18:19">19</ref></char></note>“Malè, malè, gran vil la, sila ki te abiye an lèn fen, mov e wouj la, ki te anbeli ak lò, pyè presye, ak pèl yo; <verse eid="REV 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17"/>Paske nan yon èdtan, gran richès sa a gen tan vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:6">Rev 17:6</ref></char></note>gaspiye!” Epi tout kaptenn bato ak tout pasaje, tout maren e tout sila ki fè lavi yo nan travay lanmè yo, te kanpe a yon distans.<verse eid="REV 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18"/>“E yo t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:30">Éz 27:30</ref></char></note>kriye anmwey lè yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:9">Rev 18:9</ref></char></note>wè lafimen dife li a, e t ap di: “Ki vil ki tankou gran vil sila a?” <verse eid="REV 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19"/>Konsa, yo te jete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:5">Jos 7:5</ref></char></note>pousyè sou tèt yo e t ap rele fò, kriye, lamante e t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:10">Rev 18:10</ref></char></note>“Malè, malè a gran vil sa a, ladann tout moun ki te gen bato sou lanmè yo te vin rich pa richès li, paske nan yon èdtan, li vin gaspiye nèt!” <verse eid="REV 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:48">Jr 51:48</ref></char></note>“Rejwi sou li, o syèl, e nou menm, sen, apot ak pwofèt yo, paske Bondye te pwononse jijman pou nou kont li.”<verse eid="REV 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21"/>Answit, yon zanj pwisan te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:63">Jr 51:63</ref></char></note>pran yon gwo wòch tankou yon wòch moulen. Li te voye l nan lanmè a e te di: “Konsa, gran vil la, Babylone, va jete avèk vyolans, e li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:21">Éz 26:21</ref></char></note>p ap twouve ankò. <verse eid="REV 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:8">És 24:8</ref></char></note>son sila k ap jwe ap yo, mizisyen yo, sila k ap jwe flit ak twonpèt yo p ap tande nan ou ankò. P ap ankò gen moun okenn metye k ap twouve nan ou ankò. Ni bri moulen an p ap tande nan ou. <verse eid="REV 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23"/>Menm limyè a yon lanp p ap briye nan ou, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:34">Jr 7:34</ref></char></note>vwa jennonm ak jenn fi k ap marye yo p ap tande nan ou ankò.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:23">“Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:8">És 23:8</ref></char></note>machann ou yo te gwo moun sou latè, epi tout nasyon yo te twonpe pa wanga ou a. <verse eid="REV 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24"/>Nan li menm te twouve san a pwofèt ak sen yo, ak tout sila ki te touye sou latè yo.”<verse eid="REV 18:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1"/>Apre bagay sa yo, mwen te tande yon bagay tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:48">Jr 51:48</ref></char></note>gwo vwa a yon gran foul nan syèl la ki t ap di: “Alelouya! Delivrans, laglwa ak pwisans apatyen a Bondye nou an. <verse eid="REV 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:9">Sòm 19:9</ref></char></note>Paske jijman Li yo vrè e jis. Paske Li te jije gran pwostitiye ki te konwonpi latè avèk imoralite li a, e sou li, Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Det 32:43</ref></char></note>vanje san a sèvitè Li yo.”<verse eid="REV 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3"/>“Yon dezyèm fwa, li te di: ‘Alelouya! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:10">És 34:10</ref></char></note>Lafimen li an monte pou tout tan e pou tout tan.’”<verse eid="REV 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:4">Rev 4:4</ref>,<ref loc="REV 4:10">10</ref></char></note>venn-kat ansyen yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:6">Rev 4:6</ref></char></note>kat kreyati vivan yo a te tonbe pou adore Bondye ki chita sou twòn nan e t ap di: “Amen, Alelouya!”<verse eid="REV 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5"/>Epi yon vwa te vini sòti nan twòn nan e t ap di: “Bay lwanj a Bondye nou an, nou tout, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:18">Rev 11:18</ref></char></note>sèvitè Li yo, nou menm ki gen lakrent li, piti kou gran.”<verse eid="REV 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6"/>Answit, mwen te tande yon bagay tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:48">Jr 51:48</ref></char></note>vwa a yon gran foul, tankou son a anpil dlo, tankou gwo bri a anpil kout tonnè, ki t ap di: “Alelouya! Paske Senyè a, Bondye nou an, Toupwisan an renye. <verse eid="REV 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7"/>Annou rejwi nou, fè kè nou kontan e bay glwa a Li menm. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:23">Ef 5:23</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 5:32">32</ref></char></note>maryaj a Jèn Mouton an gen tan vini, e lamarye Li a gen tan prepare.” <verse eid="REV 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8"/>Yo te bay a lamarye a pou abiye li an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:14">Rev 19:14</ref></char></note>lèn fen, briyan e pwòp, paske lèn fen an se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:4">Rev 15:4</ref></char></note>zak ladwati a sen yo.<verse eid="REV 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9"/>Answit, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:1">Rev 17:1</ref></char></note>zanj lan te di mwen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:19">Rev 1:19</ref></char></note>“Ekri, ‘Beni se sila ki envite nan resepsyon maryaj a Jèn Mouton an.’” Epi li te di mwen: “Sa yo se vrè pawòl a Bondye.”<verse eid="REV 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10"/>Answit, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:8">Rev 22:8</ref></char></note>mwen te tonbe nan pye li pou adore li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:26">Trav 10:26</ref></char></note>Men li te di mwen: “Pa fè sa! Mwen se yon sèvitè parèy ak ou, e frè ou ki kenbe temwayaj a Jésus a. Adore Bondye, paske temwayaj a Jésus a se lespri pwofesi a.”<verse eid="REV 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11"/>Mwen te wè syèl la ouvri, e vwala, yon cheval blan, e Sila ki te chita sou li a, rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:14">Rev 3:14</ref></char></note>Fidèl e Veritab. Avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 96:13">Sòm 96:13</ref></char></note>ladwati Li jije e fè lagè.<verse eid="REV 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 10:6">Dan 10:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Zye Li se flanm dife, e sou tèt li se anpil kouwòn. Li gen non yo ki ekri, ak yon non ekri sou Li ke pèsòn pa konnen, eksepte Li menm. <verse eid="REV 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13"/>Li abiye avèk yon vètman ki tranpe nan san. Non Li rele a, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:1">Jn 1:1</ref></char></note>“Pawòl Bondye a”.<verse eid="REV 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14"/>Lame ki nan syèl yo, ki abiye an lèn fen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:4">Rev 3:4</ref></char></note>blan, ki pi nèt, t ap swiv li sou cheval blan yo.<verse eid="REV 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15"/>Nan bouch Li, te sòti yon nepe file. E avèk li, Li kapab frape nasyon yo. Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Sòm 2:9</ref></char></note>gouvène yo avèk yon baton an fè. Li va foule pèz diven ak gwo kòlè Bondye Toupwisan an. <verse eid="REV 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16"/>Epi sou vètman Li ak kwis Li, Li gen yon non ki ekri: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:14">Rev 17:14</ref></char></note>“WA DÈ WA E SENYÈ DÈ SENYÈ.”<verse eid="REV 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17"/>Answit, mwen te wè yon zanj ki te kanpe nan solèy la. Li te kriye fò avèk yon gwo vwa e t ap di a tout zwazo ki vole nan mitan syèl yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:44">I Sam 17:44</ref></char></note>“Vin rasanble pou gwo resepsyon Bondye a; <verse eid="REV 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18"/>pou nou kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 39:18-20">Éz 39:18-20</ref></char></note>manje chè a wa yo, chè a kòmandan yo, chè a moun pwisan yo, chè a cheval yo, chè a sila ki chita sou yo, e chè a tout lèzòm; kit moun lib, kit esklav, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:16">Rev 13:16</ref></char></note>piti kou gran.”<verse eid="REV 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19"/>Konsa, mwen te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:7">Rev 11:7</ref></char></note>bèt la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:14">Rev 16:14</ref>,<ref loc="REV 16:16">16</ref></char></note>wa latè ak lame yo rasanble pou fè lagè kont Sila ki te chita sou cheval la ak kont lame Li.<verse eid="REV 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20"/>Epi bèt la te vin kaptire, e avèk li menm, fo pwofèt ki te fè sign <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:12">Rev 13:12</ref></char></note>nan prezans li yo. Avèk sila yo li te twonpe sa yo ki te resevwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:16">Rev 13:16</ref></char></note>mak a bèt la, ak sa yo ki te adore imaj li yo. Toude sa yo te jete tou vivan nan lak dife ki brile avèk souf la.<verse eid="REV 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21"/>Rès la te touye avèk nepe ki te sòti nan bouch a Sila ki te chita sou cheval la, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:17">Rev 19:17</ref></char></note>tout zwazo yo te vin ranpli avèk chè yo.<verse eid="REV 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1"/>Answit, mwen te wè yon zanj ki t ap desann sòti nan syèl la, ki te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:18">Rev 1:18</ref></char></note>kle abim nan ak yon gwo chèn nan men l.<verse eid="REV 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2"/>Li te pran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Jen 3:1</ref></char></note>dragon an, sèpan ansyen an, ki se dyab la, Satan, e li te mare li pou mil ane. <verse eid="REV 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3"/>Li te jete li nan labim. Li te fèmen li e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:17">Dan 6:17</ref></char></note>mete so li sou li, pou li pa t kab twonpe nasyon yo ankò, jiskaske mil ane yo fini. Apre bagay sa yo, li oblije vin lage pou yon ti tan.<verse eid="REV 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4"/>Answit mwen te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7:9</ref></char></note>twòn yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat 19:28</ref></char></note>ak sa yo ki te chita sou yo. Konsa, jijman te vin bay a yo menm. Mwen te wè nanm a sila ki te dekapite akoz temwayaj a Jésus yo, e akoz pawòl Bondye a: Sila ki pa t adore bèt la oubyen imaj li a, e ki pa t resevwa mak la sou fon yo ak men yo. Sila yo te vin retounen a lavi pou renye avèk Kris pandan mil ane.<verse eid="REV 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5"/>Rès mò yo pa t retounen a lavi jiskaske mil ane yo fini. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:14">Luc 14:14</ref></char></note>Sa se premye rezirèksyon an. <verse eid="REV 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:13">Rev 14:13</ref></char></note>Beni e sen se sila ki gen yon pati nan premye rezirèksyon an. Sou sila yo, dezyèm lanmò a pa gen pouvwa, men yo va touprè a Bondye e a Kris, e va renye avèk Li pandan mil ane yo.<verse eid="REV 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7"/>Lè mil ane yo vin fini, Satan va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:2">Rev 20:2</ref></char></note>lage soti nan prizon li an, <verse eid="REV 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8"/>epi li va soti pou twonpe nasyon ki nan kat kwen latè yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:2">Éz 38:2</ref></char></note>Gog avèk Magog, pou rasanble yo ansanm pou lagè a. An kantite, yo va tankou sab ki bò lanmè. <verse eid="REV 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9"/>Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:1">Rev 17:1</ref></char></note> monte vini sou gwo sifas latè a, e te antoure kan a sen yo ak vil byeneme a. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:7">Rev 19:7</ref></char></note>dife te desann sòti nan syèl la, e te devore yo.<verse eid="REV 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10"/>Epi dyab la ki te twonpe yo a te jete nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:20">Rev 19:20</ref></char></note>lak dife ak souf la, kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:13">Rev 16:13</ref></char></note>bèt la ak fo pwofèt la ye tou. Yo va toumante lajounen kon lannwit, pou tout tan e pou tout tan.<verse eid="REV 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11"/>Konsa, mwen te wè yon gwo twòn blan, ak Sila ki te chita sou li a. De prezans Li, tè a ak syèl la te sove ale. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:35">Dan 2:35</ref></char></note>Pa t gen plas pou yo.<verse eid="REV 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12"/>Mwen te wè mò yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:13">Rev 11:13</ref></char></note>gran kon piti, vin kanpe devan twòn nan. Yo te ouvri liv yo. Epi yon lòt liv te ouvri, ki se liv lavi a, e mò yo te jije selon bagay ki te ekri nan liv yo, selon zèv yo. <verse eid="REV 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13"/>Lanmè a te bay mò ki te ladann yo. Lanmò ak sejou lanmò yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:19">És 26:19</ref></char></note>bay mò ki te ladann yo. Yo te vin jije, yo chak selon zèv pa yo.<verse eid="REV 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14"/>Answit, lanmò ak sejou lanmò yo te jete nan lak dife a. Sa se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:6">Rev 20:6</ref></char></note>dezyèm lanmò a, lak dife a.<verse eid="REV 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15"/>Si non a nenpòt moun pa t twouve ekri nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:5">Rev 3:5</ref></char></note>liv lavi a, li te jete nan lak dife a.<verse eid="REV 20:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1"/>Epi mwen te wè yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">És 65:17</ref></char></note>syèl tounèf ak yon tè tounèf. Paske premye syèl la ak premye tè a te pase, e nanpwen lanmè ankò.<verse eid="REV 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2"/>Mwen te wè vil sen an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:12">Rev 3:12</ref></char></note>Jérusalem tounèf la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:10">Eb 11:10</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 11:16">16</ref></char></note>desann sòti nan syèl la kote Bondye. Li te prepare tankou yon lamarye ki abiye pou mari li.<verse eid="REV 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3"/>Epi konsa, mwen te tande yon gwo vwa sòti nan twòn nan ki t ap di: “Gade, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:1">Lev 26:1</ref></char></note>tabènak Bondye a pami lèzòm, e Li va rete pami yo. Yo va pèp Li, e Li va Bondye yo. Li menm, va pami yo tankou Bondye yo. <verse eid="REV 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4"/>Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">És 25:8</ref></char></note>siye tout dlo ki sòti nan zye yo. P ap gen lanmò ankò. P ap genyen lamante ankò, ni kriye, ni doulè, paske premye bagay yo fin pase.”<verse eid="REV 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:9">Rev 4:9</ref></char></note>Sila ki te chita sou twòn nan te di: <char style="wj">“Gade, m ap fè tout bagay vin tounèf.”</char> Epi Li te di: <char style="wj">“Ekri, paske pawòl sa yo fidèl e vrè.” </char><verse eid="REV 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6"/>Answit, Li te di mwen: <char style="wj">“Mwen se Alfa a ak Omega a, kòmansman an ak lafen an.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">És 55:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen va bay a sila ki swaf yo nan sous dlo lavi a san frè.</char> <verse eid="REV 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:7">Rev 2:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Sila ki venkè a va eritye bagay sa yo.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">II Sam 7:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen va Bondye Li e li va fis Mwen.</char><verse eid="REV 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8"/>
    <char style="wj">Men pou kapon yo, enkredil yo, abominab ak asasen yo, moun imoral yo, majisyen yo, idolat ak tout mantè yo, pati pa yo va nan lak ki brile avèk dife ak souf la, ki se dezyèm lanmò a.”</char><verse eid="REV 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 17:1">Rev 17:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Answit, youn nan sèt zanj ki te gen sèt gode ki te plen avèk sèt dènye fleyo yo te vini pale avè m. Li t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:7">Rev 19:7</ref></char></note> “Vini isit la. Mwen va montre ou lamarye a, madanm Jèn Mouton an.” <verse eid="REV 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:2">Éz 40:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:2">Rev 21:2</ref></char></note>li te pote mwen ale nan lespri a nan yon gwo mòn wo, e li te montre m vil sen an, Jérusalem, ki t ap desann sòti nan syèl la kote Bondye. <verse eid="REV 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11"/>Li te gen laglwa Bondye. Li te klere tankou yon pyè presye ki koute trè chè, tankou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:3">Rev 4:3</ref></char></note>pyè jasp klè tankou kristal. <verse eid="REV 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12"/>Li te gen yon gwo miray wo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 48:31-34">Éz 48:31-34</ref></char></note>avèk douz pòt. Nan pòt yo, te gen douz zanj, epi non yo te ekri sou yo, ki se non a douz tribi a fis Israël yo. <verse eid="REV 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13"/>Te gen twa pòt nan lès, twa pòt nan nò, twa pòt nan sid, e twa pòt nan lwès. <verse eid="REV 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14"/>Epi miray vil la te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:10">Eb 11:10</ref></char></note>douz wòch nan fondasyon an, e sou yo, se te douz non a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:26">Trav 1:26</ref></char></note>douz apot Jèn Mouton an.<verse eid="REV 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15"/>Sila ki te pale avè m nan te gen yon baton mezi ki te fèt an lò pou mezire vil la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:12">Rev 21:12</ref>,<ref loc="REV 21:21">21</ref>,<ref loc="REV 21:25">25</ref></char></note>pòtay li yo, ak miray li a. <verse eid="REV 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16"/>Vil la te fèt kòn yon kare. Longè li te menm fòs ak lajè li. Li te mezire vil la avèk baton an: de-mil-de-san kilomèt. Longè li, lajè li ak wotè li te egal. <verse eid="REV 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17"/>Epi li te mezire miray li a, swasann-douz mèt, selon mezi a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:11">Det 3:11</ref></char></note> yon moun, sa vle di, yon zanj.<verse eid="REV 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18"/>Materyèl miray la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:11">Rev 21:11</ref></char></note>jasp. Vil la se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:21">Rev 21:21</ref></char></note>lò pi, tankou vit klè. <verse eid="REV 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19"/>Fondasyon pou miray vil la te dekore avèk tout kalite pyè presye. Wòch premye fondasyon an se te jasp, dezyèm nan, Safi, twazyèm nan, agat, katriyèm nan, emwod, <verse eid="REV 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20"/>senkyèm nan, oniks, sizyèm nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:3">Rev 4:3</ref></char></note>sadwàn, setyèm nan, krizolit, uityèm nan, beril, nevyèm nan, topaz, dizyèm nan, krizopraz, onzyèm nan, tikwaz, douzyèm nan, ametis. <verse eid="REV 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21"/>Epi douz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:12">Rev 21:12</ref>,<ref loc="REV 21:15">15</ref>,<ref loc="REV 21:25">25</ref></char></note>pòtay yo se te douz pèl. Chak pòtay te yon sèl pèl. Epi ri vil la te an lò pi, tankou vit klè.<verse eid="REV 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22"/>Mwen pa t wè tanp ladann, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:8">Rev 1:8</ref></char></note>Senyè Bondye Toupwisan an ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:6">Rev 5:6</ref></char></note>Jèn Mouton an se te tanp li. <verse eid="REV 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23"/>Vil la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:19">És 60:19</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 60:20">20</ref></char></note>pa gen bezwen solèy oubyen lalin pou klere sou li, paske laglwa Bondye te klere li, e lanp li se te Jèn Mouton an. <verse eid="REV 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:3">És 60:3</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 60:5">5</ref></char></note>Nasyon yo va mache pa limyè li. E wa latè yo va pote laglwa nasyon yo ladann.<verse eid="REV 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25"/>Nan lajounen (paske p ap gen lannwit la), pòtay li yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:11">És 60:11</ref></char></note>p ap janm fèmen.<verse eid="REV 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26"/>Konsa, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:10">Sòm 72:10</ref></char></note>pote laglwa ak lonè a nasyon yo ladann pou yo ka antre.<verse eid="REV 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27"/>P ap gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">És 52:1</ref></char></note>anyen ki pa pwòp. Moun ki pratike abominasyon ak manti p ap janm antre ladann, men sèlman sila ke non yo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:5">Rev 3:5</ref></char></note>ekri nan liv lavi a Jèn Mouton an.<verse eid="REV 21:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1"/>Answit, li te montre m yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 46:4">Sòm 46:4</ref></char></note>rivyè dlo lavi a, klè tankou kristal, ki t ap vini sòti nan twòn Bondye a ak Jèn Mouton an, <verse eid="REV 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2"/>nan mitan lari li a. Sou chak bò larivyè a, se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Jen 2:9</ref></char></note>pyebwa lavi a, ki pote douz kalite fwi, ki bay fwi li chak mwa. Epi fèy pyebwa yo te pou gerizon a nasyon yo.<verse eid="REV 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 14:11">Za 14:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>P ap gen madichon ankò. Twòn a Bondye a ak Jèn Mouton an va ladann l, e sèvitè Li yo va sèvi Li. <verse eid="REV 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4"/>Yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 42:2">Sòm 42:2</ref></char></note>wè figi Li, e non Li va sou fon yo.<verse eid="REV 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5"/>Epi p ap gen lannwit ankò. Yo p ap gen bezwen ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:19">És 60:19</ref></char></note>limyè a yon lanp ni limyè solèy la, paske Senyè a, Bondye va klere yo. Yo va renye pou tout tan e pou tout tan.<verse eid="REV 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6"/>Konsa, Li te di mwen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:9">Rev 19:9</ref></char></note>“Pawòl sa yo fidèl e vrè”. Senyè a, Bondye a tout lespri pwofèt yo, te voye zanj Li pou montre sèvitè li yo bagay ki dwe rive nan yon ti tan tou kout.<verse eid="REV 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Gade byen, Mwen ap vini vit.</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:3">Rev 1:3</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Beni se sila ki prete atansyon a pawòl pwofesi ki nan liv sila a.” </char><verse eid="REV 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:1">Rev 1:1</ref></char></note>Mwen, Jean, se sila ki te tande e wè bagay sa yo. Konsa, lè m te tande e wè yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:10">Rev 19:10</ref></char></note>mwen te tonbe nan pye a zanj ki te montre m bagay sa yo pou adore l.<verse eid="REV 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9"/>Men, li te di mwen: “Pa fè sa! Mwen se yon sèvitè parèy a ou menm, frè ou ki te pwofèt yo, ak sila ki prete atansyon a pawòl de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:11">Rev 1:11</ref></char></note>liv sa a. Olye sa, adore Bondye.” <verse eid="REV 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10"/>Epi li te di mwen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 8:26">Dan 8:26</ref></char></note>“Pa sele pawòl pwofesi a liv sila a, paske tan an pwòch. <verse eid="REV 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 3:27">Éz 3:27</ref></char></note>Kite sila ki fè mal la, kontinye fè mal. Kite sila ki sal la, kontinye sal. Kite sila ki dwat la, kontinye pratike ladwati. E kite sila ki sen an, kontinye kenbe tèt li sen.<verse eid="REV 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Gade byen, Mwen ap vini vit! </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:10">És 40:10</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Rekonpans Mwen va avè M, pou rann a chak moun selon sa li te fè.</char> <verse eid="REV 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13"/><char style="wj">Mwen se Alfa a ak Omega a,</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">És 44:6</ref></char></note><char style="wj">premye a ak dènye a, kòmansman an ak lafen an.” </char><verse eid="REV 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14"/>
    <char style="wj">Beni se sila ki</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:14">Rev 7:14</ref></char></note><char style="wj">lave vètman yo, pou yo kapab gen dwa nan pyebwa lavi a, e kapab, pa</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:27">Rev 21:27</ref></char></note><char style="wj">pòtay yo, antre nan vil la.</char><verse eid="REV 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mat 8:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj">Deyò se chen yo, majisyen yo, moun imoral yo, asasen yo, idolat ak tout sila ki renmen e ki gen pratik bay manti.</char><verse eid="REV 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mwen, Jésus, te voye</char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:1">Rev 1:1</ref></char></note><char style="wj">zanj Mwen an pou temwaye a ou menm bagay sa yo pou legliz yo. Mwen se rasin ak ras David la, zetwal briyan nan maten an.” </char><verse eid="REV 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 2:7">Rev 2:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lespri a ak lamarye a di: “Vini”. Kite sila ki tande a di: “Vini!” Kite sila ki swaf la vini. Kite sila ki vle pran dlo lavi a san frè a vini.<verse eid="REV 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18"/>Mwen temwaye a tout sila ki tande pawòl a pwofesi liv sila a: si yon moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:2">Det 4:2</ref></char></note>ajoute nan yo, Bondye va ajoute a li menm tout fleyo ki ekri nan liv sila a. <verse eid="REV 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19"/>Epi si yon moun retire nan pawòl a liv pwofesi sila a, Bondye va retire pati pa l nan pyebwa lavi ak vil sen an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:10-22:5">Rev 21:10—22:5</ref></char></note>ki ekri nan liv sila a.<verse eid="REV 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20"/>Sila ki temwaye a bagay sa yo di: <char style="wj">“Wi, </char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:7">Rev 22:7</ref></char></note><char style="wj">Mwen ap vini vit.” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Amen. Vini, Senyè Jésus.<verse eid="REV 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:20">Wo 16:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gras Senyè a Jésus avèk nou tout. Amen.<verse eid="REV 22:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22"/>
</usx>
